(11, 'Hovik Kassis', '<p><strong>Associate Partner</strong></p><p>Hovik Kassis is a Sales Director and Investor Advisor, recognized as a top professional in Dubai\'s Real Estate market. With over 7 years of experience in the Primary Market, he has successfully managed numerous high-valued portfolios and sold properties worth AED 70 million in the past few years. In 2017, he was honored with the top performer award for new developments, cementing his position as one of the highly accomplished expert in his field.</p>', 'hovik@morgansrealty.com', 'hovik@morgansrealty.com', '971528133403', '971528133403', 'images/image_1733922668.png', 1, '2024-12-11 20:11:08', '2024-12-17 18:40:06'),
