(258, 'JLT Cluster M | HDS Business Centre | 2403', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Jumeirah Lake Towers, JLT Cluster M, HDS Business Centre', 'images/image_1733925368.png', '1348', 2, 0, '150000', 150000.00, 0, 0, NULL, 22, 'Morgan’s International Realty is pleased to offer you this exclusive office space for rent in HDS Business Centre in Jumeirah Lakes Towers, Dubai.\n\nThis fully fitted office is ideal for a mid-sized company, featuring fit-outs of the highest standards.\n\nProperty Features:\n\nSize: 1,349 sq. ft.\nFully fitted\nHigh floor\nPrivate washrooms\nReserved parking space\nClose to metro station\n\nNearby places:\n\nMalls:\nDubai Marina Mall: 0.51 KM\nDubai Pearl Mall: 3.45 KM\nIbn Battuta Mall: 3.77 KM\n\nTransport: \n\nJumeirah Lake Towers - Red Line: 0.39 KM\nDubai Marina - Red Line: 1.31 KM\nJumeirah Island - Red Line: 1.47 KM\n\nHospitals/Clinics:\n\nTop Medical Center: 1.31 KM\nTop Modern Dental Clinic: 1.42 KM\nWelcare Ambulatory Care Center: 2.98 KM\n\nFor more details, please call or email us at: marketing@morgansrealty.com\nORN: 21186\n\nAt Morgan’s International Realty, each our team members aim to leave clients with a pleasant memory of their past, standing by and guiding them in their present and planning for their future.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:56:08', '2024-12-11 20:56:11', 'jlt-cluster-m-hds-business-centre-2403', 11, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '4,5,6,7,8,9', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'FULLY FITTED | HIGH FLOOR | CLOSE TO METRO', 'mir-GD3580', '55.1380504,25.0641917', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 18:45:37\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-GD3580\",\"offering_type\":\"Rental\",\"property_type\":\"Office Space\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":{\"yearly\":\"150000\"},\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"service_charge\":\"1\",\"cheques\":\"2\",\"title_en\":\"FULLY FITTED | HIGH FLOOR | CLOSE TO METRO\",\"description_en\":\"Morgan\\u2019s International Realty is pleased to