(259, 'JLT Cluster F | HDS Tower | 1502', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Jumeirah Lake Towers, JLT Cluster F, HDS Tower', 'images/image_1733925371.png', '1257', 2, 0, '130000', 130000.00, 0, 0, NULL, 22, 'Morgan&#39;s International Realty is pleased to offer you this furnished office space in HDS Tower in Jumeriah Lake Towers (JLT), Dubai.\n\n\nHDS Tower is a 40-storey office building in JLT Cluster F, Jumeirah Lakes Towers, Dubai. The building offers an excellent work-life balance with several lifestyle amenities within the tower for people to enjoy.\n\nProperty features:\n- Size: 1,258 sqft\n- 1 reserved parking space\n- Close to metro station\n- 24 Hour Security\n- High Tech Intelligent Building Management System\n\nNear by places:\n\nThe Walk JBR: 1.1KM\nMarina Walk: 1.5KM\n\nMalls:\nDubai Marina Mall: 0.51 KM\nDubai Pearl Mall:3.45 KM\nIbn Battuta Mall:3.77 KM\n\nTransport:\nJumeirah Lake Towers - Red Line:0.39 KM\nDubai Marina - Red Line:1.31 KM\nJumeirah Island - Red Line:1.47 KM\n\nHospitals/Clinics:\nTop Medical Center:1.31 KM\nTop Modern Dental Clinic:1.42 KM\nWelcare Ambulatory Care Center:2.98 KM\n\n\nAbout us: \n\nAt Morgan’s International Realty, we pride ourselves on creating lasting impressions and unforgettable experiences for our clients. Our dedicated team members are here to accompany you on your real estate journey, ensuring that every step of the way is filled with warmth, support, and personalized guidance. Let us be your trusted partners as we help you create cherished memories of the past, navigate the present with confidence, and plan for an exciting future ahead. Join us and experience the difference with Morgan’s International Realty.\n\n\nFor more details please call or email us at : marketing@morgansrealty.com\nORN: 21186', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:56:11', '2024-12-11 20:56:14', 'jlt-cluster-f-hds-tower-1502', 11, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '4,10,11,5,12,9', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Furn