(260, 'Mazaya Business Avenue | Mazaya Business Avenue BB2 | 2008', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Jumeirah Lake Towers, Mazaya Business Avenue, Mazaya Business Avenue BB2', 'images/image_1733925374.png', '1267', 1, 0, '105000', 105000.00, 0, 0, NULL, 22, 'Morgan&#39;s International Realty is pleased to offer you this office space in Mazaya Business Avenue in Jumeriah Lake Towers (JLT), Dubai.\n\nMazaya Business Avenues project comprises of not only one but 3 commercial towers. Mazaya Business Avenue 3 is one of them with a total of 45 floors as well as features modern offices, business centers, state of the art recreation centers, meeting room, retail plazas, cafes, etc.\nThis freehold multi-building commercial complex features state-of-the-art office space, meeting rooms, retail and recreation areas and business centres. It also boasts several world-class amenities for tower occupants.\n\nProperty features:\n- Size: 1,267 sqft\n- Fitted Office\n- 1 reserved parking space\n- Close to metro station\n\nAttractions:\n- The Walk JBR:1.6 km\n- Marina Walk:1.9 km\n- Ain Dubai Observation Wheel:2.5 km\n\nParks & beaches:\n- JLT Park:0.8 km\n- Marina Beach:1.7 km\n- Al Nakhla Park:5.6 km\n\nFor more details please call or email us at : marketing@morgansrealty.com\nORN: 21186', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:56:14', '2024-12-11 20:56:16', 'mazaya-business-avenue-mazaya-business-avenue-bb2-2008', 11, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '13,14,15,16', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fully Fitted | Spacious Office | High Floor', 'mir-GD1566', '55.1460028,25.0694291', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 18:45:37\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-GD1566\",\"offering_type\":\"Rental\",\"property_type\":\"Office Space\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":{\"yearly\":\"105000\"},\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"service_charge\":\"1\",\"cheques\":\"1\",\"title_en\":\"Fully Fitted | Spacious Office | High Floor\",\"description_en\":\"Morgan&#39;s