(261, 'Lake Central | 1809', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Business Bay, Lake Central, ', 'images/image_1733925377.png', '708', 1, 0, '200000', 200000.00, 0, 0, NULL, 22, 'Morgan\'s International Realty is pleased to present an exceptional office space located in the vibrant Lake Central area of Business Bay. This prime property offers an ideal environment for businesses looking to thrive in one of the most sought-after commercial districts.\n\nProperty Features and Details :\n\n* 708.2 sq ft\n* ⁠Fully fitted, unfurnished. Glass partitions exist\n* ⁠Attached Bathroom\n* Pantry ensuite\n* Well-lit and Bright Space\n* ⁠4 office zones including the reception\n* 1 Parking Slot in the Basement and additional parking is available on a monthly rental basis \n* ⁠Chiller charges payable by the tenant monthly (consumption + demand charges) plus the deposit to the chiller management company (Logic)\n* ⁠Utility bills payable by the tenant\n* ⁠Open for a long-term tenancy \n* ⁠Traffic friendly (not so loaded comparing to other parts of Business Bay)\n* ⁠CCTV Security\n* Reception\n\nNearby Places :\n\n* Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall (5 min drive)\n* Bay Square (2 min drive)\n* Business Bay Metro Station (15-20 min by bus)\n* Cafes, Restaurants and Supermarkets are in a close proximity\n\nBusiness Bay is known for its dynamic atmosphere, with a mix of residential, commercial, and retail spaces, making it an attractive choice for professionals. The area is home to a diverse community, offering numerous dining, entertainment, and leisure options within close proximity.\n\nMorgan\'s International Realty is a luxury real estate brokerage and property investment consultancy firm. Established in Dubai at a tipping point of the industry, to create an impact in a market which was just evolving empowered by a joint effort of the public and private sectors, aiming to change the perception of the market and market players.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:56:16', '2024-12-11 20:56