verse community, offering numerous dining, entertainment, and leisure options within close proximity.\\n\\nMorgan\'s International Realty is a luxury real estate brokerage and property investment consultancy firm. Established in Dubai at a tipping point of the industry, to create an impact in a market which was just evolving empowered by a joint effort of the public and private sectors, aiming to change the perception of the market and market players.\",\"private_amenities\":\"Central air conditioning,Covered parking,Near supermarket,Near public transportation,Near metro,Near restaurants,Basement parking,Security,City view,Maintenance,Office partitions,Cleaning services,Near Hotel,Heating,Pantry,Reception area,Lobby in Building\",\"plot_size\":\"708\",\"plot_size_measure\":\"Square Foot\",\"size\":\"708\",\"size_measure\":\"Square Foot\",\"bedroom\":\"0\",\"bathroom\":\"1\",\"agent\":{\"id\":\"003Sq00000G5be1IAB\",\"name\":\"Sofia Matviets-Teo\",\"email\":\"sofia@morgansrealty.com\",\"phone\":\"971527430613\",\"photo\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/avatar\\/c22d2cc02bdca92f6e1d234f081f7dbc.jpg\\/public\"},\"title\":\"Agent\"},\"listing_status\":\"Active\",\"parking\":\"0\",\"photo\":{\"url\":[\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/4631bbbe46a7f1edd531249184ea257b-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/da1d7f0e48033bd0c65d4790d70b0337-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/cdf685c50c99ec27affc320964c6537f-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/c08ef33c488923