(263, 'Stella Maris', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Dubai Marina, Stella Maris, ', 'images/image_1733925382.png', '1536', 3, 2, '210000', 210000.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgan&#39;s International Realty is proud to present this 2 bedroom fully furnished modern apartment. Located in the heart of Dubai Marina is a brand new ready development called Stella Maris. Stella Maris is the place to live for those who appreciate a luxury lifestyle. There is direct access onto the marina walk and fantastic views of Dubai Marina, Arabian Gulf Sea and Jumeirah Lake Towers. \n\nProperty Features:\n- Fully furnished with luxury furniture\n- 2 Bedrooms\n- 3 Bathrooms\n- Ultra Modern\n- Brand New\n- 1,536 Sqft\n- Large Overlooking Balcony\n- Reception / Concierge\n- 24/7 Security\n- Sauna & Steam Room\n- Gym For Men / Gym For Ladies\n- Swimming Pool Adult / Kids\n- In & Outdoor Play Areas\n- Private Theater Room\n- Outdoor Pool\n- Shopping Mall / Supermarket\n- Dining Outlets / Restaurant\n- Marina & Yacht Club / Marina Beach\n\nAccessibility and Transportation:\n\n- 17 Minute&#39;s to the Dubai Mall / Burj Khalifa - Dubai Fountain\n- 5 Minute&#39;s, to Dubai Media City\n- 27 Minute&#39;s to Dubai Airport DXB\n- 20 Minute&#39;s to Dubai Expo City\n\nFor viewing or more information please contact me on WhatsApp or Email mert@morgansrealty.com', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:56:21', '2024-12-11 20:56:25', 'stella-maris', 14, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '24,25,4,13,26,27,28,5,29,30,16', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'AVAILABLE NOW | FULLY FURNISHED | BRAND NEW', 'mir-MU2412', '55.13248950000001,25.0699495', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-03-18 10:56:51\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-MU2412\",\"offering_type\":\"Rental\",\"property_type\":\"Apartment\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":{\"yearly\":\"210000\"},\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"cheques\":\"2\",\"title_en\":\"AVAILABLE NOW | FULLY FURNISHED | BRAND NEW\",\"description_en\":\"M