(264, 'Vida Residences Dubai Marina', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Dubai Marina, Vida Residences Dubai Marina, ', 'images/image_1733925386.png', '743', 2, 1, '144000', 144000.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgan\'s International proudly presents a brand new, 1 bedroom waterfront apartment with stunning and unique wide views of the Dubai City Skyline, gorgeous nautical inspired architecture.\n\nSet sail from the yacht club, shop your heart out at Marina Mall and enjoy world-class dining, entertainment, hotels, spas and recreation—all just steps away\n\nProperty Details:\n\n* Size 743 sq. ft\n* Handing over on 26th June\n* Access to 5* hotel amenities\n* Guest toilet\n* Pool\n* 24/7 Security\n* Play kids area\n* Adults entertainment area\n* Outdoor and indoor lounge\n* Jacuzzi\n* Ladies gym and Gentlemen gym \n* Minutes away from Dubai Marina Mall\n* Walk to metro, dining, spas & retail outlets \n\nGet in touch with listing agent Mert today to book a viewing.\n\nAt Morgan’s International Realty each of our team members aim to leave clients with a pleasant memory of their past, standing by and guiding them in their present and planning for their future.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:56:25', '2024-12-11 20:56:34', 'vida-residences-dubai-marina', 14, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '24,25,4,13,26,27,28,5,31,29,32,30,16,33', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BRAND NEW 1 BR | LUXURY FINISH | VACANT', 'mir-MU4472', '55.1362915,25.0722834', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-03-18 10:56:51\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-MU4472\",\"offering_type\":\"Rental\",\"property_type\":\"Apartment\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":{\"yearly\":\"144000\"},\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"cheques\":\"1\",\"title_en\":\"BRAND NEW 1 BR | LUXURY FINISH | VACANT\",\"description_en\":\"Morgan\'s International proudly presents a brand new, 1 bedroom waterfront apartment with stunning and unique wide views of the Dubai City Skyline, gorgeous nautical inspired architecture.\\n\\nSet sail from the yacht club, shop your heart out at Marina Mall and enjoy world-class dining, entertainment, hotels, spas and recreation\\u2014all just steps away\\n\\nProperty Details:\\n\\n* Size 743 sq. ft\\n* Handing over on 26th June\\n* Access to 5* hotel amenities\\n* Guest toilet\\n* Pool\\n* 24\\/7 Security\\n* Play kids area\\n* Adults entertainment area\\n* Outdoor and indoor lounge\\n* Jacuzzi\\n* Ladies gym and Gentlemen gym \\n* Minutes away from Dubai Marina Mall\\n* Walk to metro, dining, spas & retail outlets \\n\\nGet in touch with listing agent Mert today to book a viewing.\\n\\nAt Morgan\\u2019s International Realty each of our team members aim to leave clients with a pleasant memory of their past, standing by and guiding them in their present and planning for their future.\",\"description_multilingual\":[],\"private_amenities\":\"Balcony,Built in wardrobes,Central air conditioning,Covered parking,Shared swimming pool,Shared Gym,Kitchen Appliances,Security,Pets allowed,Concierge Service,Maid Service,Children\'s Play Area,Lobby in Building,Children\'s Pool\",\"size\":\"743\",\"size_measure\":\"Square Foot\",\"bedroom\":\"1\",\"bathroom\":\"2\",\"agent\":{\"id\":\"003J7000001TqWQIA0\",\"name\":\"Rafic Elhusseiny\",\"email\":\"rafic@morgansrealty.com\",\"phone\":\"971529025724\",\"photo\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/avatar\\/0cf96428c0452f25bc2bb5d6ff9d785f.jpg\\/public\"},\"title\":\"Agent\"},\"listing_status\":\"Active\",\"parking\":\"1\",\"furnished\":\"Unfurnished\",\"photo\":{\"url\":[\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/0ab29e474c74cda7b112c46139b7b9ab-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/34af47582f1fdf1e488b2e3629f69531