(265, 'Jasmine Leaf', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Al Barari, Jasmine Leaf, Jasmine Leaf 4', 'images/image_1733925395.png', '12908', 9, 7, '1100000', 1100000.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgans International Realty is delighted to present this exceptional 7-bedroom villa, offering an unparalleled living experience in a tranquil and gated community.\n\nProperty Features:\n\n7 bedrooms\nWalk-in closets\n9 bathrooms\nBasement for additional living space\nThree elegant living rooms\nStylish dining room\nOpen kitchen fully equipped with modern appliances\nClosed kitchen\nMaid&#39;s room\nPlot size: 10,953 sq. ft. | Built-up area: 12,908 sq. ft.\nPrivate pool\nThree large balconies for breathtaking views\nBBQ area\nRoof-top terrace\nDirect access to the river\nBeautiful nature surrounding the property\nJust a 1-minute walk to the nearby farm restaurant\nTwo parking spaces\nLocated in a calm neighborhood\nConvenient Distances:\n\n22 minutes to downtown\n26 minutes to Marina\n28 minutes to DXB airport\n23 minutes to the Mall of Emirates\n\nAl Barari is an exclusive residential community nestled in the heart of Dubai, known for its lush greenery, serene environment, and luxurious lifestyle. The community consists of meticulously designed villas, each offering a unique architectural style and high-end finishes. Al Barari is renowned for its spaciousness, with generous plot sizes and well-appointed living spaces. The villas are surrounded by beautifully landscaped gardens, giving residents a sense of peace and serenity.\n\nAt Morgan&#39;s International Realty, each of our team members aims to leave clients with a pleasant memory of their past, standing by and guiding them in their present, and planning for their future.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:56:35', '2024-12-11 20:56:40', 'jasmine-leaf', 15, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '24,25,4,13,34,35,36,37,38,5,31,39,40,41,42,30,33', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '7BR Villa | Riverside | Private Po