(266, 'West Village-', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Al Furjan, West Village, ', 'images/image_1733925400.png', '6477', 7, 5, '500000', 500000.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Welcome to Morgan\'s International Realty, where we are thrilled to showcase this stunning brand-new custom-built, four-bedroom villa in the sought-after Al Furjan West Village, now available for rent.\n\nThis exquisite villa boasts:\n\n-Four spacious bedrooms\n-Seven luxurious bathrooms\n-Maids\' and drivers\' rooms for added convenience\n-A brand-new building offering modern amenities\n-A private garden oasis\n-A refreshing swimming pool for relaxation\n\nThe ground floor welcomes you with a generously sized lounge area, a well-appointed closed kitchen, and a guest bedroom featuring an en-suite bathroom. Upstairs, the first floor boasts three large bedrooms, each with its own balcony, along with an extra spacious masters bedroom complete with an en-suite bathroom. Additionally, a second living area upstairs provides ample space for relaxation and entertainment.\n\nAl Furjan is renowned for its modern infrastructure and amenities, offering residents a vibrant lifestyle amidst contemporary architecture and lush landscaped surroundings. With parks, schools, and retail facilities in close proximity, Al Furjan promotes a family-friendly environment tailored for comfort and convenience. Each villa within the community is unique, providing residents with a range of options to suit their preferences and lifestyle needs.\n\nAt Morgan\'s International Realty, our dedicated team members strive to create pleasant memories for our clients, standing by them in the present and assisting in planning for their future. Experience unparalleled service and expertise as we guide you towards your dream home in Al Furjan and beyond.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:56:40', '2024-12-11 20:56:48', 'west-village', 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '24,25,4,13,43,44,17,45,11,18,34,35,36,28,38,31,46,42,47,32', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brand New l Vacant l Independent l Private Pool', 'mir-ZA2530', '55.1353854,25.0236604', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-03-22 13:00:13\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-ZA2530\",\"offering_type\":\"Rental\",\"property_type\":\"Villa\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":{\"yearly\":\"500000\"},\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"cheques\":\"2\",\"title_en\":\"Brand New l Vacant l Independent l Private Pool\",\"description_en\":\"Welcome to Morgan\'s International Realty, where we are thrilled to showcase this stunning brand-new custom-built, four-bedroom villa in the sought-after Al Furjan West Village, now available for rent.\\n\\nThis exquisite villa boasts:\\n\\n-Four spacious bedrooms\\n-Seven luxurious bathrooms\\n-Maids\' and drivers\' rooms for added convenience\\n-A brand-new building offering modern amenities\\n-A private garden oasis\\n-A refreshing swimming pool for relaxation\\n\\nThe ground floor welcomes you with a generously sized lounge area, a well-appointed closed kitchen, and a guest bedroom featuring an en-suite bathroom. Upstairs, the first floor boasts three large bedrooms, each with its own balcony, along with an extra spacious masters bedroom complete with an en-suite bathroom. Additionally, a second living area upstairs provides ample space for relaxation and entertainment.\\n\\nAl Furjan is renowned for its modern infrastructure and amenities, offering residents a vibrant lifestyle amidst contemporary architecture and lush landscaped surroundings. With parks, schools, and retail facilities in close proximity, Al Furjan promotes a family-friendly environment tailored for comfort and convenience. Each villa within the community is unique, providing residents with a range of options to suit their preferences and lifestyle needs.\\n\\nAt Morgan\'s International Realty, our dedicated team members strive to create pleasant memories for our clients, standing by them in the present and assisting in planning for their future. Experience unparalleled service and expertise as we guide you towards your dream home in Al Furjan and beyond.\",\"description_multilingual\":[],\"private_amenities\":\"Balcony,Built in wardrobes,Central air conditioning,Covered parking,Near school,Near hospital,Near supermarket,Near mall,Near metro,Near restaurants,BBQ area,Maids Room,Private Garden,Kitchen Appliances,Study,Pets allowed,Near airport,Walk-in Closet,Terrace,Maid Service\",\"plot_size\":\"5265\",\"plot_size_measure\":\"Square Foot\",\"size\":\"6477\",\"size_measure\":\"Square Foot\",\"bedroom\":\"5\",\"bathroom\":\"7\",\"agent\":{\"id\":\"003J7000001TqWLIA0\",\"name\":\"Zain Al Atasi\",\"email\":\"zain@morgansrealty.com\",\"phone\":\"971588632574\",\"photo\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/avatar\\/8092bbee9b41a1b8bd38e92b4eeffced.jpg\\/public\"},\"title\":\"Agent\"},\"listing_status\":\"Active\",\"parking\":\"0\",\"photo\":{\"url\":[\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/efc175aed9844cd28263e4c0e8980a97-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/d694326a9b50e856413d9d7caa2c6b58-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/170cfb029d0804551fc77b6cfc44f5d9-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/8a2413d27d833e0775378e164c0943fa-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/03628ba35b2bc02b6de44ce1fb0b3379-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/image