(269, 'Aykon City', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Business Bay, Aykon City, Aykon City Tower B', 'images/image_1733925413.png', '673', 1, 1, '0', 0.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgan’s International Realty is pleased to present this exquisite 1 BR unit in Aykon City Tower B.\n\nNestled in one of the most sought-after locations, this contemporary unit offers an ideal blend of luxury and functionality. With a modern open-plan layout, this unit maximizes space while providing a warm and inviting atmosphere.\n\nProperty Details : \n\n- 1 BR\n- Equiped Kitchen\n- Large Window\n- Stylish Interior\n- Furnished Unit\n- 672.63 sq ft.\n\nBuilding Amenities : \n\n- Swimming Pool\n- Fitness Center\n- Kid\'s Play Area\n- Central Air Conditioning\n- Concierge \n- 24/7 Security \n\n\nSituated in the heart of Dubai, this 1 BR unit offers unparalleled access to shopping, dining, and entertainment options. With excellent transport links nearby, commuting to the rest of the city is effortless.\n\nWhether you are a first-time buyer, a young professional, or an investor looking to expand your portfolio, this unit presents a fantastic opportunity in a thriving community.\n\nAt Morgans International Realty, we believe that real estate is not just about transactions; it\'s about building lasting relationships and creating memorable experiences for our clients. Each of our team members is dedicated to ensuring that every client walks away with a positive and unforgettable impression of their journey with us.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:56:53', '2024-12-11 20:56:55', 'aykon-city', 18, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '25,4,26,27,19,5,2,7,22,30,16', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'HIGH ROI | LONG TERM RENTAL | SPACIOUS UNIT', 'mir-AY9844', '55.2519287,25.1804229', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 09:10:47\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-AY9844\",\"offering_type\":\"Purchase\",\"property_type\":\"Apartment\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":\