(270, 'Murooj Al Furjan', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Al Furjan, Murooj Al Furjan, ', 'images/image_1733925415.png', '2562', 4, 3, '0', 0.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgans International Realty is thrilled to present our latest signature listing: a stunning 3-bedroom Type B residence in the sought-after Murooj Al Furjan community. Discover the perfect blend of luxury and comfort in this exceptional property! \n\nProperty details : \n\n- 3 Bedrooms \n- 4 Bathrooms \n- 2561.81 Sq ft \n- Unfurnished \n- 1 Parking space \n- Balcony \n- Premium Stylish Kitchen \n- Secure & Family Friendly Neighbourhood \n\nAmenities : \n\n- Swimming pool \n- Kids play area \n- Basketball court \n- Tennis court \n\nNearby Areas:\n\n6 minutes from Al Furjan Metro Station\n11 minutes from Ibn Battuta Mall\n16 minutes from Dubai Marina\n20 minutes from Palm Jumeirah\n25 minutes from Al Maktoum International Airport (DWC)\n28 minutes from Downtown Dubai \n\nMurooj Al Furjan\'s prime location offers residents easy access to major Dubai highways, with the Expo 2020 exhibition just 15 minutes away via Sheikh Zayed Road and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road. Ibn Battuta Mall is also a quick 15-minute drive, and Dubai Marina is accessible in just 25 minutes, providing unmatched convenience right at your doorstep. \n\nAt Morgan’s International Realty, we pride ourselves on creating lasting impressions and unforgettable experiences for our clients. Our dedicated team members are here to accompany you on your real estate journey, ensuring that every step of the way is filled with warmth, support, and personalized guidance.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:56:55', '2024-12-11 20:56:57', 'murooj-al-furjan', 16, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '24,4,13,26,27,28,5,42,30,33', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Unfurnished | 3 Spacious BR | Prime location', 'mir-ZA7831', '55.1437493,25.0282999', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 09:10:42\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-ZA