(271, 'Elie Saab VIE Townhouses', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Meydan, Elie Saab VIE Townhouses, ', 'images/image_1733925417.png', '2015', 5, 4, '0', 0.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgan’s International Realty is pleased to offer this Branded 4 Bedroom townhouse developed by the iconic fashion designer, Elie Saab. \nIn a community still under development, to be handed over soon, here comes an exciting opportunity to have the privilege of being one of the first to acquire your property ahead of anyone else ! Discover the luxury living with this exquisite 4-bedroom villa offering a perfect blend of comfort and elegance.\n\nProperty Features:\n\n•⁠  ⁠4 Bedrooms + Maid\n•⁠  ⁠5 Bathrooms\n•⁠  ⁠Built-in Wardrobes\n•⁠  ⁠landscaped Garden\n•⁠  ⁠Fully furnished\n•⁠  ⁠BUA: 2,015 Sq.ft\n•⁠  ⁠Plot Size: 2,770 Sq.ft\n•⁠  ⁠Asking Price: 4,500,000 AED\n\nAbout the community:\n\n•⁠  ⁠Gated community\n•⁠  ⁠Swimming Pool\n•⁠  ⁠Kid’s Play Area\n•⁠  ⁠Basketball courts\n•⁠  ⁠Beauty Salon\n•⁠  ⁠Community Centre including restaurants, supermarkets, and so many other shops\n\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n12 min to Mall of the Emirates \n20 min to Downtown \n25 min to Dubai International Airport\n\nAt Morgan’s International Realty each of our team members aim to leave clients with a pleasant memory of their past, standing by and guiding them in their present and planning for their future.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:56:57', '2024-12-11 20:56:59', 'elie-saab-vie-townhouses', 19, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '24,4,13,26,48,27,42,30,33', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Luxurious 4 BR | Ready unit fully furnished VOT', 'mir-MB2110', '55.2755715,25.1979325', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 09:10:42\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-MB2110\",\"offering_type\":\"Purchase\",\"property_type\":\"Villa\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":\"4500000\",\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"service_charge\":\"0\",\"cheques\":\"0\",\"title_en\":\"Luxurious 4 BR | Read