(272, 'La Mer', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Jumeirah, La Mer, Port de La Mer', 'images/image_1733925420.png', '778', 1, 1, '0', 0.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgan’s International Realty is pleased to offer this Fantastic off-plan One Bedroom Apartment for sale in La Sirene, Port De La Mer.\n\nProperty Features:\n\n* 778 Sq. Ft\n* 1 Bedroom\n* 1 Bathroom\n* Partial Water View\n* High Floor\n* Open Kitchen Style\n* Laundry Room\n* Built-in Wardrobes\n* Designated Parking (1)\n* Terrace\n* Asking Price: 2,200,000 AED\n* Handover December 2024\n\nAbout the community:\n\n* Park\n* Gym\n* Swimming Pool\n* Walking Port Trails\n* Kid’s Play Area\n* Pet-Friendly Area\n* Beach & Marina Access\n* Retails & Restaurants\n* Yacht Club\n\nNearby Locations:\n\n13 min to City Walk\n17 min to Dubai Mall & Burj Khalifa\n20 min to Kite ,Beach\n25 min to Dubai International Airport\n36 min to Marina\n39 min to Sharjah\n\nThe prominent development La Sirene by Meraas Holding offers 1, 2, 3 & 4 bedroom low-rise apartments in the most sought-after community of Port De La Mer in Jumeirah, Dubai. The community promises a marina-side lifestyle with fascinating terra cotta roofs, whitewashed stone works, pastel exteriors, and lush greenery with a balcony. The Residence consists of various units with ultra-modern finishing and well-designed interiors to inspire a modern-day living lifestyle.\n\nThe residence is inspired by the Mediterranean and offers a unique marina promenade and an easy seafront lifestyle with its Panoramic views of the open sea and Dubai skyline.\n\n\nAt Morgan’s International Realty, each of our team members aim to leave clients with a pleasant memory of their past, standing by and guiding them in their present and planning for their future.\n\n\nPlease do not hesitate to get in touch for further information.\n  Alireza Oveisi Rastabi​ +971 52 790 4367', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:56:59', '2024-12-11 20:57:05', 'la-mer', 20, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '25,4,13,26,27,28,5,6,40,47,30', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ready Soon | Partial Water View | High Floor', 'mir-AO6925', '55.2522821,25.2416543', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 09:10:37\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-AO6925\",\"offering_type\":\"Purchase\",\"property_type\":\"Apartment\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":\"2200000\",\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"service_charge\":\"0\",\"cheques\":\"0\",\"title_en\":\"Ready Soon | Partial Water View | High Floor\",\"description_en\":\"Morgan\\u2019s International Realty is pleased to offer this Fantastic off-plan One Bedroom Apartment for sale in La Sirene, Port De La Mer.\\n\\nProperty Features:\\n\\n* 778 Sq. Ft\\n* 1 Bedroom\\n* 1 Bathroom\\n* Partial Water View\\n* High Floor\\n* Open Kitchen Style\\n* Laundry Room\\n* Built-in Wardrobes\\n* Designated Parking (1)\\n* Terrace\\n* Asking Price: 2,200,000 AED\\n* Handover December 2024\\n\\nAbout the community:\\n\\n* Park\\n* Gym\\n* Swimming Pool\\n* Walking Port Trails\\n* Kid\\u2019s Play Area\\n* Pet-Friendly Area\\n* Beach & Marina Access\\n* Retails & Restaurants\\n* Yacht Club\\n\\nNearby Locations:\\n\\n13 min to City Walk\\n17 min to Dubai Mall & Burj Khalifa\\n20 min to Kite ,Beach\\n25 min to Dubai International Airport\\n36 min to Marina\\n39 min to Sharjah\\n\\nThe prominent development La Sirene by Meraas Holding offers 1, 2, 3 & 4 bedroom low-rise apartments in the most sought-after community of Port De La Mer in Jumeirah, Dubai. The community promises a marina-side lifestyle with fascinating terra cotta roofs, whitewashed stone works, pastel exteriors, and lush greenery with a balcony. The Residence consists of various units with ultra-modern finishing and well-designed interiors to inspire a modern-day living lifestyle.\\n\\nThe residence is inspired by the Mediterranean and offers a unique marina promenade and an easy seafront lifestyle with its Panoramic views of the open sea and Dubai skyline.\\n\\n\\nAt Morgan\\u2019s International Realty, each of our team members aim to leave clients with a pleasant memory of their past, standing by and guiding them in their present and planning for their future.\\n\\n\\nPlease do not hesitate to get in touch for further information.\\n  Alireza Oveisi Rastabi\\u200b +971 52 790 4367\",\"private_amenities\":\"Built in wardrobes,Central air conditioning,Covered parking,Shared swimming pool,Shared Gym,Kitchen Appliances,Security,On high floor,Sea\\/Water view,Terrace,Children\'s Play Area\",\"size\":\"778\",\"size_measure\":\"Square Foot\",\"bedroom\":\"1\",\"bathroom\":\"1\",\"agent\":{\"id\":\"003Sq00000G2H77IAF\",\"name\":\"Alireza Oveisi\",\"email\":\"alireza@morgansrealty.com\",\"phone\":\"971527904367\",\"photo\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/avatar\\/cad7ce1bf66260a0894122f1e9f3b396.jpg\\/public\"},\"title\":\"Agent\"},\"listing_status\":\"Active\",\"parking\":\"1\",\"photo\":{\"url\":[\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/7bed69a3a679b5c61af244df1088cd38-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/60ba039aee91f652e620bb39aa5be8c8-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/bf62d5540e4b9c1a5d6114ed212fac7e-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/b7d49ee088327e05f06ed568912e541a-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/52157c842cbb68a213aad63481e0c181-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/