(273, 'Bliss', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Arabian Ranches 3, Bliss, ', 'images/image_1733925428.png', '2239', 4, 3, '0', 0.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgans International Realty is proud to offer a unique villa in Arabian Ranches 3, a stunning community that embodies luxury and comfort. This exceptional property features modern design elements combined with spacious living areas, making it perfect for families and those seeking a serene lifestyle. \n\nProperty Details : \n\n- 2,239 sq ft\n- AED 2,950,000\n- 3 BR + M\n- 4 Bathrooms\n- Floor to Ceiling windows\n- Spacious Area\n- 1 Minute walk to community pool, club house, and retail area\n- 30% 2 years post hand-over payment plan\n\n\n10 minutes from Global Village\n10 Minutes from Dubai Polo and Equestrian Club\n20 Minutes from Downtown Dubai\n25 Minutes from Dubai International Airport\n35 Minutes from Dubai Mall\n35 Minutes from Dubai Marina\n\n\nAt Morgans International Realty, we believe that real estate is more than just transactions; it’s about creating lasting relationships and unforgettable experiences. Each member of our dedicated team strives to leave clients with a pleasant memory of their past interactions while providing unwavering support in the present.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:57:05', '2024-12-11 20:57:16', 'bliss', 21, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '48,17,45,18,49,5,46,7,41,32,30,33', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '3 BR + M | PREMIUM TOWNHOUSE | 2YR PHOP', 'mir-MK7595', '55.2892724,25.0547279', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 09:10:50\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-MK7595\",\"offering_type\":\"Purchase\",\"property_type\":\"Villa\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":\"2950000\",\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"service_charge\":\"1\",\"cheques\":\"0\",\"title_en\":\"3 BR + M | PREMIUM TOWNHOUSE | 2YR PHOP\",\"description_en\":\"Morgans International Realty is proud to offer a unique villa in Arabian Ranches 3, a stunning community that embod