(274, 'Binghatti Amber', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Jumeirah Village Circle, Binghatti Amber, ', 'images/image_1733925439.png', '696', 1, 1, '0', 0.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgans International Realty is Proud to Offer a Luxurious 1-Bedroom Unit in Binghatti Amber, JVC\n\nWe are delighted to present an exceptional opportunity to own a stunning 1-bedroom apartment in Binghatti Amber, an exclusive development in the sought-after Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC). This sophisticated residence offers the perfect combination of modern design, world-class amenities, and a prime location, making it an ideal choice for both discerning homeowners and savvy investors.\n\nProperty Details :  \n \n-	1 Bedroom\n-	1 Bathroom\n-	695.67 Sq Ft\n-	Fully Furnished\n-      Floor to ceiling windows \n\nFeature and Amenities :\n\n- Fitness Center\n- Swimming Pool\n- Kid\'s Play Area\n- Community View\n- 24/7 Security \n- Nearby Restaurants and Cafes\n\n\nAt Morgans International Realty, we believe that real estate is not just about transactions; it’s about building lasting relationships and creating meaningful experiences. Each of our team members is dedicated to providing exceptional service, ensuring that every client walks away with more than just a completed deal, but a positive, memorable experience that lasts long after the keys are handed over.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:57:16', '2024-12-11 20:57:30', 'binghatti-amber', 22, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '25,4,26,17,10,18,27,5,16', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'GREAT DEAL | PRIME LOCATION | STYLISH UNIT', 'mir-RN9392', '55.2096241,25.0625932', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 09:10:41\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-RN9392\",\"offering_type\":\"Purchase\",\"property_type\":\"Apartment\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":\"947997\",\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"service_charge\":\"0\",\"cheques\":\"0\",\"title_en\":\"GREAT DEAL | PRIME LOCATION | STYLISH UNIT\",\"description_e