(275, 'Merano Tower', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Business Bay, Merano Tower, ', 'images/image_1733925450.png', '668', 2, 1, '0', 0.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgan\'s International Realty is pleased to present this 1-bedroom apartment for sale in Merano Tower, Business Bay.\n\nMerano Tower is a 29-story residential building located in one of the best areas of Business Bay, north of the Canal. It is conveniently situated near the metro, JW Marriott, and surrounded by 9 office towers, right off Sheikh Zayed Road.\n\nProperty Details:\n* 1-Bedroom Apartment\n* Size: 668.44 sq. ft.\n* 2 Bathrooms\n* Kitchen with All Appliances\n* Spacious Balcony\n* 1 Covered Parking Space\n\nFacilities:\n- Gym or Health Club\n- Jacuzzi\n- Sauna\n- Swimming Pool\n- Balcony or Terrace\n- Lobby in Building\n- Service Elevators\n- Security Staff\n- CCTV Security\n- Broadband Internet\n- Double Glazed Windows\n- Waste Disposal\n- Maintenance Staff\n- Cleaning Services\n\nPlease note: The photos are for illustration purposes only and may not represent the actual apartment. Actual pictures are available upon inquiry.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:57:30', '2024-12-11 20:57:32', 'merano-tower', 23, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '24,25,4,48,43,44,50,17,45,49,51,36,37,19,28,5,12,39,52,53,54,14,6,55,40,56', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Investor Deal | Spacious 1-bedroom | Rented', 'mir-GJ4850', '55.2603221,25.1848281', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 09:10:35\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-GJ4850\",\"offering_type\":\"Purchase\",\"property_type\":\"Apartment\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":\"1200000\",\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"service_charge\":\"19\",\"cheques\":\"0\",\"title_en\":\"Investor Deal | Spacious 1-bedroom | Rented\",\"description_en\":\"Morgan\'s International Realty is pleased to present this 1-bedroom apartment for sale in Merano Tower, Business Bay.\\n\\nMerano Tower is a 29-story residential building located in one of the best areas of Business Bay, north of the Canal. It is conveniently situated near the metro, JW Marriott, and surrounded by 9 office towers, right off Sheikh Zayed Road.\\n\\nProperty Details:\\n* 1-Bedroom Apartment\\n* Size: 668.44 sq. ft.\\n* 2 Bathrooms\\n* Kitchen with All Appliances\\n* Spacious Balcony\\n* 1 Covered Parking Space\\n\\nFacilities:\\n- Gym or Health Club\\n- Jacuzzi\\n- Sauna\\n- Swimming Pool\\n- Balcony or Terrace\\n- Lobby in Building\\n- Service Elevators\\n- Security Staff\\n- CCTV Security\\n- Broadband Internet\\n- Double Glazed Windows\\n- Waste Disposal\\n- Maintenance Staff\\n- Cleaning Services\\n\\nPlease note: The photos are for illustration purposes only and may not represent the actual apartment. Actual pictures are available upon inquiry.\",\"private_amenities\":\"Balcony,Built in wardrobes,Central air conditioning,Community view,Near school,Near hospital,Near mosque,Near supermarket,Near mall,Fully fitted kitchen,Private garage,Private Garden,Private Pool,Basement parking,Kitchen Appliances,Security,City view,Private Gym,Private Jacuzzi,Marble floors,Sauna,Cable-ready,On high floor,Steam room,Sea\\/Water view,Basement\",\"size\":\"668\",\"size_measure\":\"Square Foot\",\"bedroom\":\"1\",\"bathroom\":\"2\",\"agent\":{\"id\":\"003J7000001TqWCIA0\",\"name\":\"Ghia Jhair\",\"email\":\"ghia@morgansrealty.com\",\"phone\":\"971529016268\",\"photo\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/avatar\\/38fb38e6eb3fde03e311dbf2164d86ad.jpg\\/public\"},\"title\":\"Agent\"},\"listing_status\":\"Active\",\"parking\":\"1\",\"furnished\":\"Unfurnished\",\"photo\":{\"url\":[\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/ae5c425d9240da3bb2e6cd6e30db49ef-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu2