(276, 'Seascape', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Mina Rashid, Seascape, ', 'images/image_1733925452.png', '1756', 3, 3, '0', 0.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgan\'s International Realty is thrilled to present an exquisite three-bedroom unit in Seascape - Building 1. This beautifully designed residence offers a generous living space, perfect for families or anyone looking for additional room to breathe.\n\nResidents of Seascape enjoy access to a variety of premium amenities, including a modern fitness center, an inviting swimming pool, and beautifully landscaped gardens for outdoor enjoyment. The community is conveniently located near shopping, dining, and recreational facilities, making it easy to enjoy everything the area has to offer.\nDon’t miss this fantastic opportunity to call this stunning unit your home. Contact us today for more information or to schedule a viewing!\n\n\n\nProperty Details : \n\n- 3 Bedrooms\n- 3 Bathrooms\n- 1,756.45 Sq Ft.\n- 2 Parking Slots\n- 2 Balconies\n- Open Kitchen\n\n\nFeature & Amenities : \n\n- Swimming Pool\n- Gym\n- Spacious\n- Central Air-conditioning\n- 24/7 Security\n- Lobby\n\nAt Morgans International Realty each of our team members aim to leave clients with a pleasant memory of their past, standing by and guiding them in their present and planning for their future.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:57:32', '2024-12-11 20:57:36', 'seascape', 24, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '24,4,26,48,27,28,5,29,40,57,22', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'High Floor | Pool View | Genuine Resale', 'mir-KR1479', '55.27739949999999,25.2575401', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 09:10:51\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-KR1479\",\"offering_type\":\"Purchase\",\"property_type\":\"Apartment\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":\"3700000\",\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"service_charge\":\"0\",\"cheques\":\"0\",\"title_en\":\"High Floor | Pool View | Genuine Resale\",\"description_en\":\"Morgan\'s Internat