(277, 'Aykon City', '<p>UAE, Dubai</p>', '<p>UAE, Dubai, Business Bay, Aykon City, Aykon City Tower B</p>', 'images/image_1733925457.png', '681', 1, 1, '0', 0.00, 1, 0, 187, 23, '<p>Morgan’s International Realty is pleased to present this exquisite 1BR unit in Aykon City Tower B. Nestled in one of the most sought-after locations, this contemporary unit offers an ideal blend of luxury and functionality. With a modern open-plan layout, this unit maximizes space while providing a warm and inviting atmosphere. Property Details : - Equiped Kitchen - Furnished Unit - 681.35 sq ft. - Big Windows - Modern Interior Building Amenities : - Swimming Pool - Fitness Center - Kid\'s Play Area - Central Air Conditioning - Concierge - 24/7 Security Situated in the heart of Dubai, this unit offers unparalleled access to shopping, dining, and entertainment options. With excellent transport links nearby, commuting to the rest of the city is effortless. Whether you are a first-time buyer, a young professional, or an investor looking to expand your portfolio, this unit presents a fantastic opportunity in a thriving community. At Morgans International Realty, we believe that real estate is not just about transactions; it\'s about building lasting relationships and creating memorable experiences for our clients. Each of our team members is dedicated to ensuring that every client walks away with a positive and unforgettable impression of their journey with us.</p>', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:57:36', '2024-12-16 19:18:17', 'aykon-city-2', 18, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2, 4, 5, 17, 19, 25, 26, 27, 30', NULL, NULL, '1 BHK', 1, NULL, NULL, 'HIGH ROI | LONG TERM RENTAL | SPACIOUS UNIT', 'mir-AY9926', '55.2519287,25.1804229', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 09:10:47\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-AY9926\",\"offering_type\":\"Purchase\",\"property_type\":\"Apartment\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":\"1299000\",\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"service_charge\":\"0\",\"cheques\":\"0\",\"title_en\":\"HIGH ROI | LONG TERM RENTAL | SPACIOUS UNIT\",\"description_en\":\"Morgan\\u2019s International Realty is pleased to present this exquisite 1BR unit in Aykon City Tower B.\\n\\nNestled in one of the most sought-after locations, this contemporary unit offers an ideal blend of luxury and functionality. With a modern open-plan layout, this unit maximizes space while providing a warm and inviting atmosphere.\\n\\nProperty Details : \\n\\n- Equiped Kitchen\\n- Furnished Unit\\n- 681.35 sq ft.\\n- Big Windows\\n- Modern Interior\\n\\nBuilding Amenities : \\n\\n- Swimming Pool\\n- Fitness Center\\n- Kid\'s Play Area\\n- Central Air Conditioning\\n- Concierge \\n- 24\\/7 Security \\n\\nSituated in the heart of Dubai, this unit offers unparalleled access to shopping, dining, and entertainment options. With excellent transport links nearby, commuting to the rest of the city is effortless.\\n\\nWhether you are a first-time buyer, a young professional, or an investor looking to expand your portfolio, this unit presents a fantastic opportunity in a thriving community.\\n\\nAt Morgans International Realty, we believe that real estate is not just about transactions; it\'s about building lasting relationships and creating memorable experiences for our clients. Each of our team members is dedicated to ensuring that every client walks away with a positive and unforgettable impression of their journey with us.\",\"private_amenities\":\"Built in wardrobes,Central air conditioning,Shared swimming pool,Near supermarket,Shared Gym,Basement parking,Security,Spa,Children\'s Play Area\",\"size\":\"681\",\"size_measure\":\"Square Foot\",\"bedroom\":\"1\",\"bathroom\":\"1\",\"agent\":{\"id\":\"003Sq00000G2NXBIA3\",\"name\":\"Aykut Almaz\",\"email\":\"aykut@morgansrealty.com\",\"phone\":\"971521164093\",\"photo\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/ho