(1, 'Nakheel\'s Dubai Islands Community: A Premium Investment Destination', 'investment-nakheels-dubai-islands-community-a-premium-investment-destination', '<p>addres</p>', '<p>dateio locat</p>', 'featured_images/featured_image_1733320395.png', '12.00', 0, 3123, 12.00, 123.00, 1, 0, 9, 21, '<p>proerty dscritio</p>', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-04 20:53:15', '2024-12-04 20:53:15', 7, NULL, NULL, 'Dubai Hills Estate', '<p>descritpion</p>', 'button', '#', 'button 2', '#', '2', NULL, 'blog_background/blog_background_1733320395.png', '1 BHK', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2, 'Residential Land for Sale Dubai Marina – Morgan’s International Realty', 'rare-residential-plot-for-sale-in-dubai-marina', '<p>address</p>', '<p>dateio locat</p>', 'featured_images/featured_image_1733320395.png', '12.00', 0, 3123, 12.00, 123.00, 1, 0, 9, 21, '<p>Morgan\'s International Realty is proud to present a very rare freehold plot for sale in Dubai Marina</p><p>2B + G +15 Floors</p><p>Plot area : 36,200 SQ.FT</p><p>Total Built up area : 312,802 SQ.FT</p><p>Net Saleable area : 183,214 SQ.FT</p><p>Retail area : 2,500 SQ.FT</p><p>Dubai Marina is one of <strong>the most sought-after neighborhoods in Dubai</strong>. This impressive community boasts luxury skyscrapers, a range of dining and entertainment options, and best of all, it offers urban waterfront living to its residents. It is the most popular area for <strong>renting &amp; buying luxury apartments in Dubai.</strong></p><h3>In A Nutshell</h3><ul><li>Home to over 200 luxurious residential towers</li><li>Predominantly an apartment community, but also features villas</li><li>Great waterfront views from most buildings</li><li>Residential apartments boast luxurious amenities and state-of-the-art facilities</li><li>Hosts community events throughout the year</li><li>Home to Dubai Marina Mall, Dubai Marina Walk, and other attractions</li><li>&nbsp;</li></ul><h3>Local Community</h3><p>Dubai Marina is a meticulously planned community, complete with a seamless network of roads and a picturesque marina, filled with luxury yachts. It is a true testament to master developer, <strong>Emaar Properties</strong>, who turned <strong>a 3.5 km strip of shoreline into a 6,452,391 sq. ft.</strong> modern neighborhood that offers a chic <strong>Riviera-style lifestyle</strong>. A pivotal feature of this multi-purpose neighborhood is the large canal, it stretches over 3.5 km providing access to the sea on both ends. Potential residents can choose from an assortment of <strong>luxurious apartments</strong> in high-rise buildings, set against the gorgeous backdrop of the marina.</p><p>There are more than <strong>200 residential towers in Dubai Marina</strong>, each offering spectacular views of the city and the harbor. Dubai Marina is known as the <strong>‘tallest block in the world’</strong> and many of the Dubai Marina buildings are part of Dubai’s iconic skyline. Living in Dubai Marina offers residents a vibrant community lifestyle.</p><h3>Public Transportation in Dubai Marina</h3><p>There are two metro stations near Marina: Damac Properties Metro Station and DMCC Metro Station. The roads tend to get busy in the evenings, the metro can be a good way to shorten the time it takes for you to get home after work. Getting around the neighbourhood is a lot easier with the Dubai Tram, with its 11 tram stations, stretching from JBR to Al Sufouh. There are a few tram stations in the community as well, such as the Marina Towers Tram Station near Marina Pinnacle and MAG 218 Tower.</p><h3>Malls in Dubai Marina</h3><p>There is yet to be an area in Dubai that doesn’t have a mall for you to get your shopping fix. <strong>Dubai Marina Mall</strong>, located conveniently on Sheikh Zayed Road, offers residents a variety of retail options, covering everything from high-street fashion, retail stores, a supermarket and more.</p><p><strong>JBR’s The Beach</strong> mall is also close to the marina, offering residents an outdoorsy and off-beat shopping experience. There is a smaller selection of luxury fashion brands and speciality stores in this mall.</p><h2>Get the Best Land for Sale in Dubai - Buying Luxurious Properties Made Easy!</h2><p>At Morgan’s International Realty, we provide lavish properties with the best features to serve our clients in the best possible way. To deliver on the promise of the best brokerage service, we offer a luxurious residential land for sale in Dubai.</p><p>With rich experience in the Dubai real estate market, we are an acclaimed, award-winning firm and one of the supreme brokerage companies in Dubai. This amazing reputation is earned and attained through constant hard work and positive outcomes for clients via a solid network of strategic, professional and multilingual real estate teams.</p><h2>Invest in Lavishing Real Estate in Dubai</h2><p>Dubai is a beautiful city that is constantly evolving, with new innovative developments emerging all the time. And buying residential land in Dubai might be a great decision.</p><p>Branded and luxury properties provide higher yields and hassle-free management. If you are considering investing in Dubai, you might be wondering why. Here’s the reason:</p><p><strong>• Capital Appreciation:</strong> Investing in Dubai’s residential land and properties is a smart move because the potential for capital appreciation is high. Luxury or Branded apartments in Dubai are designed by well-known architects and built by renowned developers. These branded apartments and ultra-lavish properties often come with a diverse range of top-notch amenities that amplifies your lifestyle.</p><p><strong>• Elite Lifestyle:</strong> Dubai is popular for its luxury lifestyle. And investing/buying a land for sale in this city can give you a chance to experience this elite lifestyle.</p><p><strong>• Prime Address:</strong> Location is a critical aspect while investing in residential lands. Dubai Marina is one of the most luxurious locations in the city that offers unparalleled views and access to the best places for shopping, dining and entertainment.</p><p><strong>• Short-Term Rentals:</strong> Dubai is a popular destination for tourists and business travellers, and there is a high demand for short-term rentals. It offers opportunities for the owners of luxury properties to charge premium rents.</p><p><strong>• Tax-Free Environment:</strong> Dubai is known for its investor-friendly rules. If you will invest in Dubai, you don’t have to pay any kind of tax (income tax, capital gains tax, rental revenue tax, etc). This attracts investors from around the globe to Dubai who want to invest in real-estate.</p><h2>We Are Your Go-To Team for Finding Luxury Properties in Dubai</h2><p>Explore and find the best-in-class apartments, penthouses, townhouses, villas and land for sale across Dubai. Located in some of the most prime locations and communities, these homes are designed to cater to the need of your elite lifestyle.</p><p>Some of the top Dubai communities for residential homes include Dubai Marina, Palm Jumeirah and the Downtown district. Waterfront property complexes are always a popular choice, offering a resort-like atmosphere and luxury amenities to match. People also show high interest in branded and high-maintenance residences, which provide a complete lifestyle package where residents can live their life hassle-free.</p><p>For families moving to Dubai and planning to stay for a longer time, villa rentals are a great option. The city is home to several well-planned communities that are designed to provide a comfortable family lifestyle.</p><h2>Why Choose Dubai Marina for Your Dream Apartment?</h2><p>Dubai Marina is one of the most desired neighbourhoods in Dubai. This impressive community has lavishing skyscrapers and a range of dining and entertainment options. And guess what? It offers urban waterfront living to its residents, which is the most popular area for renting &amp; buying luxury apartments in Dubai.</p><h2>Ready to Buy the Luxurious Properties in Dubai? Let’s Talk!</h2><p>If you want to buy or looking to buy luxurious properties, villas, or residential land in Dubai, we would be more than happy to assist you. Just drop in an email give us a call and we’ll get back to you.</p>', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-04 20:53:15', '2024-12-05 20:14:15', 7, NULL, NULL, 'Dubai Hills Estate', '<p>descritpion</p>', 'button', '#', 'button 2', '#', '2', '<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Residential Land for Sale Dubai Marina – Morgan’s International Realty\" /><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explore residential land for sale in Dubai at Morgan’s International Realty. We are a real estate brokerage and property investment consultant with the finest portfolio of apartments, villas and penthouses for sale in Dubai.\" />', 'blog_background/blog_background_1733320395.png', '1 BHK', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(4, 'Building For Sale Jumeirah Golf estates', 'investment-building-for-sale-jumeirah-golf-estates', '<p>Address</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 21, '<p>Looking for the perfect investment opportunity? Look no further! This full building in the highly sought-after Jumeirah Golf Estate is now available for sale at an attractive price.</p><p>Situated in the heart of Jumeirah Golf Estate, this building boasts a prime location and easy access to all the amenities and conveniences the area has to offer. The building itself is in excellent condition, with spacious units and modern finishes.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>This stunning G+2 Floors building in the highly coveted Jumeirah Golf Estate is now available for sale at an attractive price. Boasting a total of 29 apartments, this building is perfect for investors looking to capitalize on the growing demand for rental properties in the area.</p><p>The building comprises 21 spacious 1BR apartments and 8 elegant 2BR apartments, all finished to a high standard with modern fixtures and fittings. The total built-up area of the building is an impressive 27,472 SQ.FT, providing plenty of space for residents to spread out and enjoy a comfortable, relaxed lifestyle.</p><p>Located in the heart of Jumeirah Golf Estate, this building is just a short distance from all the amenities and conveniences the area has to offer. From world-class golf courses and fitness centers to a wide range of dining and shopping options, everything is at your fingertips.</p><p>Don\'t miss out on this fantastic opportunity to own a full building in Jumeirah Golf Estate. Contact us today for more information and to schedule a tour.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Full Building available for sale at a very attractive price tag</strong></p><p>Located in Jumeirah Golf Estates</p><p>High end finishing</p><p>estimated 20% capital apprication expected</p><p>8% return on investment expected</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Apartments break down:</strong></p><p>G+2 Floors building</p><p>21 1BR apartments</p><p>8&nbsp;&nbsp; 2BR apartment</p><p>total number of apartments : 29</p><p>total buit up area : 27,472 SQ.FT</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Development features:</strong></p><p>5 Andalusian heritage sites</p><p>2 Golf Courses</p><p>6 hectares of landscaping zones</p><p>Jogging &amp; cycling tracks that blend in naturally with the surrounding landscaping</p><p>Gym, swimming &amp; tennis for a fitness-focused lifestyle</p><p>5 lakes and an array of wildlife and foliage.</p><p>Spectacular views of two golf courses</p><p>2 Clubhouses</p><h2>Get the Luxury Jumeirah Golf Estates Villas for Sale in Dubai</h2><p>Situated in the heart of Jumeirah Golf Estate, this building bestows a prime location and easy access to all the amenities and conveniences the area has to offer. The building itself is in great condition, with spacious units and modern finishes.</p><p>This amazing G+2 Floors building in the highly desired Jumeirah Golf Estates is now available for sale at a tempting price. Including a total of 29 apartments, this building is great for investors looking to capitalise on the surging demand for rental properties in the area.</p><h2>Now is the Time to Invest in Dubai’s Luxury Villas</h2><p>Dubai is the best location for investors because of its investment-friendly policies. As we all know that the market was affected by the pandemic adversely, however, there are visible signs of recovery during the first quarter of 2022. And to reap its benefit, people are investing in the lavishing properties in Dubai.</p><p>Even though villas may rapidly recover, apartments are expected to see a relatively lower price rise in Dubai. Therefore, now is the best time to invest in the Jumeirah golf estates villas.</p><p>Dubai is the true paragon of luxury and grandeur. And now is the time for you to invest in the best luxury property here.</p><h2>Advantages of Investing in Villas for Sale in Dubai - A Brief Look</h2><p>Offering lavish residences and an opulent lifestyle, the residential units in the community are built with green building standards to conserve energy, build a natural environment and maintain efficient environmental procedures. You’ll find the following types of residential properties:</p><p>• Apartments</p><p>• Villas</p><p>• Mansions</p><p>Don’t miss out on this amazing opportunity to buy a building in Jumeirah golf estates and you’ll have the following benefits.</p><p><strong>• High Rental Yield:</strong> Dubai is a global market that lures people from all parts of the world for work, study, business, and leisure. This leads to a great amount of rental activity in the market. As per historical data, Dubai assures tempting Returns on Investment (ROI).</p><p><strong>• Tax-Free Investment:</strong> UAE is known for its investor-friendly policies. An investment in real estate in Dubai has no annual property tax, capital gains tax, income tax, rental revenue tax, or any additional tax. This enables the investor to dedicate a much larger financial portfolio to buying property and, in turn, get higher returns.</p><p><strong>• Golden Visa Relaxation:</strong> The UAE government has recently announced two great relaxations to its coveted Golden Visa. The Golden Visa is typically a long-term residence permit that enables foreign nationals to invest, work, study, reside and own businesses in the emirates.</p><h2>Future of Real-Estate in Dubai - A Sneak Peek</h2><p>The amazing city of Dubai is expected to continue its dominance as an investors\' heaven for the next few years. With a large number of expatriates making the city their \'home\', a good real estate environment will be maintained. However, as is the case with any foreign investment, it is suggested to duly scrutinise every outlook of the deal before signing the documents.</p><p>So what are you waiting for? Invest in luxury properties in Jumeirah Golf Estates, Dubai and get a chance to own a home in this beautiful city.</p>', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-06 16:19:10', '2024-12-06 16:33:05', 7, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1', NULL, NULL, '1 BHK', 1, 'Jumeirah Golf Estates is a world-class golf destination offering Villas and luxury homes for sale with Leisure Facilities. You have no need to go anywhere as we offer high-end finished properties/villas with unmatched lifestyles in Jumeirah Golf Estates.', 'Jumeirah Golf Estates Villas for Sale, Luxury homes with First Class Amenities', NULL);
