(21, NULL, 'Most Expensive Properties Sold in Q3 2022', '<p>Descriptio</p>', 'images/image_173252625090.png', '#link section #', 'Heading (Section II):', 'images/image_173252625091.png', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(242,239,229);color:rgb(58,53,38);\">Description (Section II):</span></p>', 'images/image_17325260330.png', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(242,239,229);color:rgb(58,53,38);\">Description 2 (Section II):</span></p>', 'Heading (Section III):', '[\"images/image_17325276200.png\", \"images/image_17325276201.png\", \"images/image_17325276202.png\", \"images/image_17325276203.png\"]', '[\"Images (Section III):\", \"Heading (Section III):\", \"Heading (Section III):\", \"Heading (Section III):\"]', 'Branded Dubai Market Report', '<p>Discover some of the very best apartments, penthouses, townhouses and villas for rent across Dubai. Located in some of the most prime communities, these homes are designed to cater to every type of lifestyle. Some of the top Dubai communities for apartment rentals include Dubai Marina, Palm Jumeirah, and the Downtown district. Waterfront apartment complexes are always popular, offering a resort-like atmosphere and amenities to match. There is also tremendous interest in branded and serviced residences, which offer a complete lifestyle package where residents don’t have to worry about any of the smaller details</p>', 'images/image_173252768593.png', '#asd', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-11-25 16:41:25', '2024-11-25 16:41:25'),
