(23, NULL, 'Most Expensive Properties Sold in Q3 2022 test', '<p>Descriptio n testing</p>', 'images/image_173252625090.png', 'https://myprojectdemonstration.net/development/morgan/web/', 'Heading (Section II): test', 'images/image_173252625091.png', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(242,239,229);color:rgb(58,53,38);\">Description (Section II): testing</span></p>', 'images/image_17325260330.png', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(242,239,229);color:rgb(58,53,38);\">Description 2 (Section II):</span></p>', 'Heading (Section III): test', '[\"images/image_17325276200.png\", \"images/image_17325276201.png\", \"images/image_17325276202.png\", \"images/image_17325276203.png\"]', '[\"Images (Section III): test\", \"Heading (Section III):\", \"Heading (Section III):\", \"Heading (Section III):\"]', 'Branded Dubai Market Report', '<p>Test Discover some of the very best apartments, penthouses, townhouses and villas for rent across Dubai. Located in some of the most prime communities, these homes are designed to cater to every type of lifestyle. Some of the top Dubai communities for apartment rentals include Dubai Marina, Palm Jumeirah, and the Downtown district. Waterfront apartment complexes are always popular, offering a resort-like atmosphere and amenities to match. There is also tremendous interest in branded and serviced residences, which offer a complete lifestyle package where residents don’t have to worry about any of the smaller details</p>', 'images/image_173252768593.png', 'https://myprojectdemonstration.net/development/morgan/web/', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-11-28 14:29:05', '2024-11-28 14:29:05'),
(24, NULL, 'Branded Residences in Dubai', '<p>In 2010, the Armani Residences in Burj Khalifa became the first branded residences to launch in Dubai. Since then, the demand for these luxurious properties has shown no signs of slowing down. Over the years, Dubai has experienced significant growth in this niche market, attracting prestigious luxury and upscale hospitality brands to create enticing developments for affluent buyers and investors. These initiatives have also provided a new stream of revenue, solidifying Dubai’s position as one of the world’s leading hubs for branded residences. By championing this transformative movement, our aim is to foster a market where everyone can benefit from Dubai’s booming branded residences sector. Through setting new standards and shaping the future of real estate, we are contributing to the growth of this vibrant city.</p>', 'images/image_173252625090.png', 'https://myprojectdemonstration.net/development/morgan/web/', 'Heading (Section II): test', 'images/image_173252625091.png', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(242,239,229);color:rgb(58,53,38);\">Description (Section II): testing</span></p>', 'images/image_17325260330.png', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(242,239,229);color:rgb(58,53,38);\">Description 2 (Section II):</span></p>', 'Heading (Section III): test', '[\"images/image_17325276200.png\", \"images/image_17325276201.png\", \"images/image_17325276202.png\", \"images/image_17325276203.png\"]', '[\"Images (Section III): test\", \"Heading (Section III):\", \"Heading (Section III):\", \"Heading (Section III):\"]', 'Branded Dubai Market Report', '<p>As property developers, clients &amp; brands recognized the immense potential of branded residences and began capitalizing on this lucrative concept, we strategically crafted a one-of-a-kind report. This report empowers investors, property developers, and global brands with valuable insights into this thriving sector. Serving as a guiding resource, it provides verified data and actionable recommendations to help stakeholders bring their visions to life and achieve optimal value from this esteemed asset class.</p>', 'images/image_173252768593.png', 'https://myprojectdemonstration.net/development/morgan/web/', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2024-11-29 19:03:15', '2024-11-29 19:03:15'),
