(19, '5 Bedroom Villa in District One - Mohammed Bin Rashid Al Maktoum City', 'district-one-mohammed-bin-rashid-city-villas', '<p>District One</p>', '<figure class=\"media\"><oembed url=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/pKkynPuJ2tvJA3yi8\"></oembed></figure>', 'featured_images/featured_image_1735209037.jpg', 8438.00, 0, 5, '25000000', 25000000.00, 1, 0, 187, 10, '<p>Morgan\'s International Realty is pleased to present this brand new 5BR Vacant Contemporary Villa directly on the Crystal Lagoon. The sparkling, one-of-a-kind Crystal Lagoon is the beating heart of Mohammed Bin Rashid Al Maktoum City — District One. Each opulent property in our lovely neighborhood offers incomparable views of the world\'s largest man-made lagoon, bringing the beach to your doorstep. In addition, you get exclusive access to the breathtaking 14-kilometer boardwalk and extensive areas of white sand beaches that surround this unique marvel in District One.&nbsp;</p><h3>Life Style</h3><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Enhance your weekends with a brief, invigorating swim against the stunning backdrop of the Dubai skyline, or revitalize yourself with a yoga practice on the beach. After a long day at the office, one can meditate to the gentle sound of the waves or take a stroll along the immaculate dunes. Experience luxurious beachfront living right in the midst of Dubai.</span></p><h2>Luxury Villas for Sale in Mohammed Rashid City - Crystal Lagoon District 1.</h2><p>We are delighted to present this brand new 5BR vacant modern Villa directly on the Crystal Lagoon. Each lavish property in our lovely neighbourhood offers exceptional views of the world\'s largest artificial lagoon. In addition, you get exclusive access to the breath-taking 14-kilometre boardwalk and extensive areas of white sand beaches that surround this unique marvel in District One.</p><h3>Mohammed Rashid City - Consider to Invest Here!</h3><p>Mohammed Bin Rashid City or Mohammed Rashid City is a prime location in Dubai for home buyers &amp; investors with an appreciation of 7.55%, and an increase in population, it is a zero tax-free zone, has a high range of properties in MBR City and bestows the largest mall.</p><p>1. <strong>Presence of Crystal Lagoon:</strong> With this, the Crystal Lagoon within the district is one of the greatest attractions that will be the largest one in the world. The main idea is to add an environmentally friendly ambience where the advanced technology makes the water look crystal blue where the resident will have access to swimming, aquatic activities, kayaking, and more to make the most of this lagoon. Important details of this city are:</p><p>• Biggest Mall - Meydan One Mall</p><p>• An array of Investment Opportunities</p><p>• Close to Business Bay</p><p>2. <strong>Proximity from Important Locations:</strong> Here we have covered all the essential spots of Dubai which is easily accessible from Mohammed Bin Rashid City with the driving time given so that you have a clear idea about location advantages.</p><p>• Global Village - 26 min</p><p>• Burj Khalifa - 9 min</p><p>• Dubai Mall - 10 min</p><p>• Ferrari World - 21 min</p><p>• Miracle Garden - 19 min</p><p>• Dubai Frame - 15 min</p><p>• Dubai Creek Harbour - 17 min</p><h2>Invest in the Best Lavish Properties in Dubai - It’s Worth It</h2><p>Villas in district 1 and properties in Dubai have long been attractive investments for local and international investment. And primary reasons for that are the city’s strong fundamentals, robust economy, tax-free statutes, and proximity to key markets. All these factors make it a smart choice to invest in villas in District 1 for businesses and people who are looking to invest in luxury properties</p><p>Despite the current fluctuation in the world economy, Dubai’s real estate market has stood strong. And this is due to the city’s strong ethics and fundamentals, including its growing population and flourishing economy.</p><p>In recent years, real estate value in Dubai has surged rapidly, driven by growing demand from businesses and investors. People are also attracted to Dubai’s property market due to its stable political environment and tax-free status. Dubai has no corporate or personal income tax, making it an ideal place for investors</p><p>So, if you are looking for villas for sale in District 1 of Mohammed Rashid City, Dubai, you’re in the right place.</p>', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-04 18:54:37', '2024-12-26 17:30:37', 22, NULL, NULL, 'Mohammed Bin Rashid City', '<p><strong>Mohammed Bin Rashid City (MBR City)</strong> is redefining luxury living in Dubai, offering an unparalleled blend of <strong>modern infrastructure</strong>, <strong>natural beauty</strong>, and <strong>world-class amenities</strong>. Whether you’re a family seeking a serene environment, a professional looking for connectivity, or an investor seeking high returns, MBR City provides unmatched value. With its strategic location, iconic developments like <strong>District One</strong> and <strong>Sobha Hartland</strong>, and future-ready infrastructure, MBR City stands as a testament to Dubai’s vision for innovation and excellence.</p>', 'Read More', NULL, NULL, NULL, '5, 7, 12, 18, 30, 31, 48, 63', NULL, 'blog_background/blog_background_1735206379.jpg', '4 BHK', 4, 'Morgan\'s International Realty is pleased to present this brand new 5BR Vacant Contemporary Villa directly on the Crystal Lagoon. The sparkling, one-of-a-kind Crystal Lagoon is the beating heart of Mohammed Bin Rashid Al Maktoum City — District One. Each opulent property in our lovely neighborhood offers incomparable views of the world\'s largest man-made lagoon, bringing the beach to your doorstep. In addition, you get exclusive access to the breathtaking 14-kilometer boardwalk and extensive areas of white sand beaches that surround this unique marvel in District One.', '5 Bedroom Villa in District One - Mohammed Bin Rashid Al Maktoum City', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d28888.33095271573!2d55.25274718464568!3d25.168080952762942!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3e5f68ff90a3d503%3A0xd96d6a13fdf5788e!2sAl%20Quoz%20-%20Ghadeer%20Al%20Tair%20-%20Dubai%20-%20United%20Arab%20Emirates!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1733312817622!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>'),
(20, 'Prime Beachfront Plot in Jumeirah Bay Island', 'emirates-hills-villas', '<p>Jumeirah Bay Island</p>', '<figure class=\"media\"><oembed url=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/qjhEn7j47AfajnMN7\"></oembed></figure>', 'featured_images/featured_image_1735208916.jpg', 17457.00, 0, 0, '150000000', 150000000.00, 1, 0, 187, 27, '<p>Discover the opportunity to build your dream home on one of Dubai’s most prestigious addresses, Jumeirah Bay Island. This exclusive beachfront plot offers unmatched luxury, privacy, and potential for a bespoke architectural masterpiece. Spanning an expansive 17,457 sqft, this plot is your blank canvas to create a residence that reflects your vision and lifestyle. With a generous Built-Up Area (BUA) allowance of 13,094 sqft and G+1 (Ground + First Floor) configuration, the possibilities are endless.&nbsp;</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li><strong>Plot Size:</strong> 17,457 sqft</li><li><strong>BUA Allowance:</strong> 13,094 sqft</li><li><strong>Configuration:</strong> G+1</li><li><strong>Direct Beach Access</strong> for unparalleled waterfront living</li><li>Exclusive location in Dubai’s premier island community</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>A Rare Opportunity in Jumeirah Bay Island</h3><p>Jumeirah Bay Island is renowned for its exclusivity and luxury, home to Dubai’s elite and high-profile residents. This <strong>private beachfront plot</strong> is one of the few opportunities to secure land in this coveted location, offering:</p><ul><li><strong>Panoramic views</strong> of the Arabian Gulf</li><li><strong>Direct access to pristine beaches</strong></li><li>A tranquil, gated community with premium security</li><li>Proximity to <strong>Bulgari Resort &amp; Residences</strong>, world-class dining, and leisure facilities</li></ul><p><br><strong>Why Invest in Jumeirah Bay Island?</strong></p><p>Jumeirah Bay Island is Dubai’s ultimate address for discerning investors and homeowners. With limited availability and increasing demand, owning land here is a wise investment in exclusivity and lifestyle.</p><ul><li><strong>Prestigious Neighborhood:</strong> A haven for ultra-high-net-worth individuals.</li><li><strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Build your dream home tailored to your preferences.</li><li><strong>Strategic Location:</strong> Minutes from Downtown Dubai and major landmarks.</li><li><strong>Long-Term Value:</strong> Properties on Jumeirah Bay Island command exceptional returns.</li></ul><p><br>With a substantial <strong>17,457 sqft plot</strong> and the ability to construct a luxurious <strong>G+1 residence</strong>, the possibilities are endless. Whether you envision a modern architectural marvel, a timeless retreat, or a family haven, this plot is your opportunity to make it a reality.</p><p>Arrange a Private Viewing Today, Register your interest!</p>', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-04 18:54:37', '2024-12-26 17:28:36', 7, NULL, NULL, 'Jumeirah Bay Island', '<p>Discover some of the very best apartments, penthouses, townhouses and villas for rent across Dubai. Located in some of the most prime communities, these homes are designed to cater to every type of lifestyle. Some of the top Dubai communities for apartment rentals include Dubai Marina, Palm Jumeirah, and the Downtown district. Waterfront apartment complexes are always popular, offering a resort-like atmosphere and amenities to match. There is also tremendous interest in branded and serviced residences, which offer a complete lifestyle package where residents don’t have to worry about any of the smaller details</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '21, 61', NULL, NULL, '1 BHK', NULL, 'Discover the opportunity to build your dream home on one of Dubai’s most prestigious addresses, Jumeirah Bay Island. This exclusive beachfront plot offers unmatched luxury, privacy, and potential for a bespoke architectural masterpiece.', 'Prime Beachfront Plot in Jumeirah Bay Island', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d28888.33095271573!2d55.25274718464568!3d25.168080952762942!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3e5f68ff90a3d503%3A0xd96d6a13fdf5788e!2sAl%20Quoz%20-%20Ghadeer%20Al%20Tair%20-%20Dubai%20-%20United%20Arab%20Emirates!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1733312817622!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>'),
(21, 'Mansion for sale in Emirates Hills', 'mansion-in-emirates-hills', '<p>Emirates Hills</p>', '<figure class=\"media\"><oembed url=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/iybnHRf56ZZEkn8K6\"></oembed></figure>', 'featured_images/featured_image_1735209013.jpg', 23000.00, 0, 6, '40000000', 40000000.00, 1, 0, 187, 26, '<p>This is a million-pound private standalone villa in a des-res lakeside location at Emirates Hills In Dubai, that simply stupefies with its traditional design and heartening two-storey layout. It was developed by EMAAR, and when we recently visited it for inspection we found it in a well-managed condition.</p><p>All the amenities you\'ll need are adjacent to you. A refreshing kidney-shaped pool for cooling off on a baking summer\'s day. A golf course for your sport and fitness pursuits. Local shops, restaurants, cafes and a school are there for all your day-to-day needs.</p><p>It comes with 6+ bedrooms including 6 masters, a fabulous living room, a dining room, a family room, entrance hall, scullery, study, driver\'s room, maid\'s room, a 5-car private garage, an impeccable peninsula kitchen with gas burners, an island, granite countertops, and irrefutable positive energy.</p><p>The spectacular lakeside view will take the breath away. What\'s more, with 23,000 sq.ft of BUA and a land parcel that\'s huge, there\'s a considerable amount of extra space to exercise your green thumb in your sunlit private garden, or for grabbing a bit of fresh air on your wide &amp; airy decked-terrace.</p><h2>Get the Best Luxurious Mansion in Emirates Hills - Morgan’s Realty!</h2><p>Dubai real estate is packed with an abundance of lavish properties. And Emirates Hills is one of those communities that offer amazingly impressive range of luxury properties. It is a gated residential community which is situated around the fresh greens of Montgomerie Golf Club Dubai.</p><p>From onsite dining choices, and gastropubs with terraces, to top-notch hotels, you have everything in one place to make your life easier and more convenient. And if we talk about properties, you\'ll have mansions with pools, a play area for children, and an educational institution.</p><p>And if you are looking for mansions for sale, Emirates Hills can be your best bet. It is the most beautiful and lavish place to buy a mansion for.</p><h2>What It’s Like to Live in a Mansion in Dubai – Benefits</h2><p>One of the top reasons why Dubai is always on the radar of investors is because it has very safe and secure residential options to choose from. To put it simply, it is the most family-friendly location in the world. However, there are many factors to consider before investing in your dream home, including work commutes, school runs, space and budget.</p><p>There is various beautifully-built mansions for sale in Dubai and all you need to do is to choose! With the number of benefits that living in a villa can give you, you can easily find the best one to fit your unique needs. Here are the benefits of living in a mansion in Dubai:</p><p><strong>• Freedom to Move:</strong> One of the prime advantages of living in a villa is its luxurious space. Compared to standard smaller-sized properties in the city quarter, Emirates Hills’ luxury villas allow you the freedom to move.</p><p><strong>• Privacy:</strong> Emirates Hills’ properties are located in the gated community where your safety, security, and privacy are the top priority.</p><p><strong>• Access to Top-Class Amenities:</strong> Properties in Dubai are located in self-contained communities. You don’t have to go to the city for your basic necessities as there are boutique shops, shopping malls, retail outlets, and supermarkets within the area. Cleaning and laundry shops, banks, pharmacies, salons, and schools are nearby. Also, there are cafes, restaurants, food trucks, and even ice cream vans to cater to your sweet tooth. Additionally, you’ll find multi-activity parks, sports facilities, play area for children, and a community swimming pool.</p><p><strong>• Opportunity to Enjoy Green Spaces:</strong> One of the prime reasons why people prefer to live in Dubai is the access they provide to green spaces and nature. Emirates Hills feature lush gardens, beautiful lakes and vast private parklands.</p><p><strong>• A Luxury Lifestyle:</strong> The thoughtfully planned communities where lavish villas and mansions are located are home to a niche group of residents. Typically, you will be neighbours with people from similar walks of life. There is a great chance that you may encounter like-minded people. It will make it easier for you to interact with people and enjoy the amenities to their fullest.</p><p><strong>• A Peaceful Community:</strong> Offering a sense of calmness, the gated neighbourhood can be the best option for families. One of the prime reasons to live in the mansion community is its healthy and peaceful environment. There are a plethora of community parks and recreational facilities in the neighbourhood to offer a luxurious lifestyle to residents.</p><h2>These are some high-value advantages of living in Dubai in a luxury villa.</h2><p>So, if you’re looking for a mansion for sale in Dubai, we have some interesting options for you. Our properties featured an exclusive portfolio of ultra-luxurious mansions and villas surrounded by lush green landscaping.</p><p>So, what are you waiting for? Contact us and get the mansion of your dreams now</p>', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-04 18:54:37', '2024-12-26 17:30:13', 13, NULL, NULL, 'Emirates Hills', '<p>Discover some of the very best apartments, penthouses, townhouses and villas for rent across Dubai. Located in some of the most prime communities, these homes are designed to cater to every type of lifestyle. Some of the top Dubai communities for apartment rentals include Dubai Marina, Palm Jumeirah, and the Downtown district. Waterfront apartment complexes are always popular, offering a resort-like atmosphere and amenities to match. There is also tremendous interest in branded and serviced residences, which offer a complete lifestyle package where residents don’t have to worry about any of the smaller details</p>', 'Read More', NULL, NULL, NULL, '24, 47, 49, 51, 53, 56, 62', NULL, 'blog_background/blog_background_1735207691.jpg', '1 BHK', 1, 'This is a million-pound private standalone villa in a des-res lakeside location at Emirates Hills In Dubai, that simply stupefies with its traditional design and heartening two-storey layout. It was developed by EMAAR, and when we recently visited it for inspection we found it in a well-managed condition.', 'Lutra Luxury Mansion for sale in Emirates Hills', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d28888.33095271573!2d55.25274718464568!3d25.168080952762942!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3e5f68ff90a3d503%3A0xd96d6a13fdf5788e!2sAl%20Quoz%20-%20Ghadeer%20Al%20Tair%20-%20Dubai%20-%20United%20Arab%20Emirates!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1733312817622!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>');
