(4, 'Residential and Commercial Property Management Services in Dubai 2', 'Property Management Explained', '<p>Property Management is a service given to owners to take away the stress and niggles of managing their property. A Property Management team is a mediatory party between an owner and a tenant to take care of an owners’ investment and ensure all of the regulatory items are taken care of including schedule of condition reports, rental cheques, maintenance management and ensuring correct notices are given to the tenants.</p>', NULL, NULL, 'Why Choose Morgan\'s', '<p>To maximize financial gains from an asset, it is crucial to implement strategic and adaptable property management strategies. These solutions aim to extract, protect, and enhance value and efficiency throughout the entire ownership process. Our property management teams are constantly proactive in the day-to-day management of your asset. We ensure the smooth operation of finding and retaining tenants, collecting rent, and overseeing maintenance and compliance. For those who possess a diverse range of commercial properties or a buy-to-let investment, we have the ability to anticipate and respond to market conditions in advance. Our objective is to customize our advice and services to ensure that your property continues to generate consistent returns on investment for as long as you possess it. Receive personalized, expert guidance whenever you\'re prepared.</p>', NULL, '2024-11-21 13:45:41', '2024-11-21 13:45:41'),
