(4, 'Research & Insights', 'images/image_17326897820.png', '<h2>Our Approach</h2><p>Over the course of a few years, we have made significant investments in our research division by hiring individuals who are passionate about data and providing them with tools and systems to validate and verify the data, followed by a world-class team of graphic designers to ensure that reports are easy to read and relatively appealing. Currently, we produce three types of reports:</p>', '#', 'Research Solutions', 'section1_images/image_17326897820.png', '<p>The purpose of these reports is to track the performance, price movement, supply, etc. of Dubai\'s key neighborhoods independently. These reports are not released publicly and are only provided to customers upon request to assist them in identifying trends from a close vantage point.</p>', 'Quarterly Community Reports', 'section1_images/image_17326897820.png', '<p>The purpose of these reports is to track the performance, price movement, supply, etc. of Dubai\'s key neighborhoods independently. These reports are not released publicly and are only provided to customers upon request to assist them in identifying trends from a close vantage point.</p>', 'Dubai Real Estate Market Reports', 'section1_images/image_17326897820.png', '<p>The purpose of these reports is to track the performance, price movement, supply, etc. of Dubai\'s key neighborhoods independently. These reports are not released publicly and are only provided to customers upon request to assist them in identifying trends from a close vantage point.</p>', 'Branded Residences Reports', 'Resources : Latest Reports in Dubai\'s Real Estate Market', 'section2_images/image_17326897820.png', 'section2_images/image_17326897820.png', 'section2_images/image_17326897820.png', 'section2_images/image_17326897830.png', 'section2_images/image_17326897830.png', 'section2_images/image_17326897830.png', 'Q3 2022', 'Q3 2022', 'Q3 2022', 'Q3 2022', 'Q3 2022', 'Q3 2022', '2024-11-27 13:43:03