(279, 'Central Park at City Walk', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, City Walk, Central Park at City Walk, Viridian', 'images/image_1733925461.png', '676', 1, 1, '0', 0.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgans International Realty is proud to present this beautiful one bedroom apartment in Viridian at Central Park - City Walk \n\nPROPERTY & AMENITIES \n\n- Size 676 Sq. ft\n- 1 Bedroom\n- 1 Bathroom\n- Mid floor\n- 50% paid and 50% upon handover \n- Covered parking\n- Balcony\n- Unfurnished\n- Central air conditioning\n- Broadband ready\n- Pools and water play\n- Kids and play area\n- Dining in Building\n- Public parking\n- Security\n- Running track\n- Dog Park\n- Multi-use games and sports lawns\n- Tennis and squash courts\n- Half-court basketball\n- Skate-able landscape\n- Games tables\n- Outdoor gym and fitness station\n- Spa and Sauna\n- Yoga and meditation areas\n- F and B and retail stores\n- Outdoor barbecue areas\n- Events area\n- Picnic pavilions\n- Nursery\n\nLOCATION\n\n- A minute\'s walk to city walk mall\n- 5 minutes to Coca-Cola Arena\n- 10 minutes to Jumeirah Beach \n- 15 minutes to Burj Al Arab & Dubai Mall\n- 15 minutes tola Mer Beach \n- 15 minutes to Dubai International Airport \n- 50 Minutes to Al Maktoum International Airport\n\n\nCity Walk is a creative lifestyle space to live, work and play in the heart of Dubai. Conceptualized by world-renowned designers, this high-end destination includes international retail offerings, upscale gourmet restaurants, world-class residences, and luxurious hotels, combining Dubai’s love for out-of-the-box thinking with contemporary convenience. Built around movement, sharing, and community, the modern urban mix and easy connectivity make it one of the most prominent and recognizable neighborhoods in the city.\n\nMorgan’s International Realty each our team members aim to leave clients with a pleasant memory of their past, standing by and guiding them in their present and planning for their future.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2