ants, world-class residences, and luxurious hotels, combining Dubai\\u2019s love for out-of-the-box thinking with contemporary convenience. Built around movement, sharing, and community, the modern urban mix and easy connectivity make it one of the most prominent and recognizable neighborhoods in the city.\\n\\nMorgan\\u2019s International Realty each our team members aim to leave clients with a pleasant memory of their past, standing by and guiding them in their present and planning for their future.\",\"private_amenities\":\"Balcony,Built in wardrobes,Central air conditioning,Covered parking,Shared swimming pool,Shared Gym,BBQ area,Security,Concierge Service,Walk-in Closet,Children\'s Play Area,Children\'s Pool\",\"size\":\"676\",\"size_measure\":\"Square Foot\",\"bedroom\":\"1\",\"bathroom\":\"1\",\"agent\":{\"id\":\"003J7000001TqWCIA0\",\"name\":\"Ghia Jhair\",\"email\":\"ghia@morgansrealty.com\",\"phone\":\"971529016268\",\"photo\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/avatar\\/38fb38e6eb3fde03e311dbf2164d86ad.jpg\\/public\"},\"title\":\"Agent\"},\"listing_status\":\"Active\",\"parking\":\"0\",\"furnished\":\"Unfurnished\",\"photo\":{\"url\":[\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/db51337a96028f172c5646e59445a9f4-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/bf276f54ed5b214423451b126913f5c6-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/6d97908409ad6cd433619eb30f7a6dc3-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/4ae21a65bd6c4d14438566bf7dc536af-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\/im