(280, 'The Orchard Place', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Jumeirah Village Circle, The Orchard Place, ', 'images/image_1733925464.png', '720', 2, 1, '0', 0.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgans International Realty is excited to present a stunning 1 bedroom apartment in The Orchard Place Tower B! This elegant space features contemporary design and luxurious finishes, perfect for modern living. Don’t miss your chance to elevate your lifestyle in this remarkable residence!\n\nProperty Details:\n\n- 1 Bedroom\n- Powder Room\n- Ensuite bathroom\n- Built-in Wardrobe\n- Balcony\n- Spacious Open Layout\n- 719.56 sq.ft.\n- Modern Finishes\n- Prime Location\n\nFeatures and Amenities:\n\n- Barbecue facilities\n- Children\'s swimming pool\n- Events area\n- Gymnasium\n- His and hers locker rooms\n- Indoor and outdoor play areas\n- Landscaped deck\n- Meeting room\n- Padel tennis courts\n- Seating areas\n- Steam and sauna rooms\n- Yoga and meditation areas\n\nWelcome to The Orchard Place Tower B, where modern elegance meets urban convenience. Our stylish residences boast contemporary designs and high-end finishes, complemented by a range of amenities. Situated in a vibrant area, residents enjoy easy access to shopping, dining, and entertainment, making it the perfect place to call home. Experience exceptional living at The Orchard Place Tower B—your new home awaits!\n\n\nAbout Us: \n\nAt Morgan’s International Realty, we pride ourselves on creating lasting impressions and unforgettable experiences for our clients. Our dedicated team members are here to accompany you on your real estate journey, ensuring that every step of the way is filled with warmth, support, and personalised guidance. Let us be your trusted partners as we help you create cherished memories of the past, navigate the present with confidence, and plan for an exciting future ahead. Join us and experience the difference with Morgan’s International Realty.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:57:44', '2024-12-11 20:57:50', 'the-orchard-place', 25, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '25,4,26,48,27,38,5,12,29,2,7,58,41,22,16', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BEST PRICE I FIVE HOTEL VIEW I RESALE', 'mir-AB7904', '55.2111623,25.0564649', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 09:10:46\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-AB7904\",\"offering_type\":\"Purchase\",\"property_type\":\"Apartment\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":\"1099000\",\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"service_charge\":\"0\",\"cheques\":\"0\",\"title_en\":\"BEST PRICE I FIVE HOTEL VIEW I RESALE\",\"description_en\":\"Morgans International Realty is excited to present a stunning 1 bedroom apartment in The Orchard Place Tower B! This elegant space features contemporary design and luxurious finishes, perfect for modern living. Don\\u2019t miss your chance to elevate your lifestyle in this remarkable residence!\\n\\nProperty Details:\\n\\n- 1 Bedroom\\n- Powder Room\\n- Ensuite bathroom\\n- Built-in Wardrobe\\n- Balcony\\n- Spacious Open Layout\\n- 719.56 sq.ft.\\n- Modern Finishes\\n- Prime Location\\n\\nFeatures and Amenities:\\n\\n- Barbecue facilities\\n- Children\'s swimming pool\\n- Events area\\n- Gymnasium\\n- His and hers locker rooms\\n- Indoor and outdoor play areas\\n- Landscaped deck\\n- Meeting room\\n- Padel tennis courts\\n- Seating areas\\n- Steam and sauna rooms\\n- Yoga and meditation areas\\n\\nWelcome to The Orchard Place Tower B, where modern elegance meets urban convenience. Our stylish residences boast contemporary designs and high-end finishes, complemented by a range of amenities. Situated in a vibrant area, residents enjoy easy access to shopping, dining, and entertainment, making it the perfect place to call home. Experience exceptional living at The Orchard Place Tower B\\u2014your new home awaits!\\n\\n\\nAbout Us: \\n\\nAt Morgan\\u2019s International Realty, we pride ourselves on creating lasting impressions and unforgettable experiences for our clients. Our dedicat