(281, 'Marina Residence', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Dubai Marina, Marina Residence, Marina Residence B', 'images/image_1733925471.png', '602', 1, 1, '0', 0.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgans International Realty is excited to present a distinctive one-bedroom apartment for sale in the prestigious Marina Residence Tower. This exceptional property is designed for those who appreciate a blend of luxury and comfort, making it the perfect urban retreat.\n\nThe apartment features an open layout that maximizes space and light, with large windows that offer stunning views of the surrounding marina and cityscape. The modern kitchen is equipped with high-end appliances and stylish finishes, making it ideal for both everyday living and entertaining guests\n\nProperty Details :   \n\n- 1 BR unit\n- 602.03 sq ft.\n- Semi closed kitchen\n- Parking Slot\n- Fully-Furnished\n- Newly Renovated\n\nBuilding Amenities : \n\n- Swimming Pool \n- Kid\'s Play Area \n- Spa \n- Concierge \n- 24/7 Security \n- Close to Metro\n- Nearby Supermarkets and Restaurants \n\nAt Morgans International Realty, we are committed to helping our clients find their perfect home. This one-bedroom apartment in Marina Residence Tower represents a fantastic opportunity to own a piece of luxury living in one of the most sought-after locations. Don’t miss the chance to make this unique space your own!', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:57:50', '2024-12-11 20:57:53', 'marina-residence', 26, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '4,13,26,48,17,10,11,18,19,38,5,12,29,2,41,30,16,33', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Smart Home | Newly Renovated | Vacant', 'mir-RD8243', '55.13773279999999,25.0722758', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 09:10:48\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-RD8243\",\"offering_type\":\"Purchase\",\"property_type\":\"Apartment\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":\"1170000\",\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"service_charge\":\"0\",\"cheques\":\"0\",\"title_en\":\"Smart Home | Newly Renovated | Vacant\",\"description_en\":\"Morgans International Realty is excited to present a distinctive one-bedroom apartment for sale in the prestigious Marina Residence Tower. This exceptional property is designed for those who appreciate a blend of luxury and comfort, making it the perfect urban retreat.\\n\\nThe apartment features an open layout that maximizes space and light, with large windows that offer stunning views of the surrounding marina and cityscape. The modern kitchen is equipped with high-end appliances and stylish finishes, making it ideal for both everyday living and entertaining guests\\n\\nProperty Details :   \\n\\n- 1 BR unit\\n- 602.03 sq ft.\\n- Semi closed kitchen\\n- Parking Slot\\n- Fully-Furnished\\n- Newly Renovated\\n\\nBuilding Amenities : \\n\\n- Swimming Pool \\n- Kid\'s Play Area \\n- Spa \\n- Concierge \\n- 24\\/7 Security \\n- Close to Metro\\n- Nearby Supermarkets and Restaurants \\n\\nAt Morgans International Realty, we are committed to helping our clients find their perfect home. This one-bedroom apartment in Marina Residence Tower represents a fantastic opportunity to own a piece of luxury living in one of the most sought-after locations. Don\\u2019t miss the chance to make this unique space your own!\",\"private_amenities\":\"Central air conditioning,Covered parking,Shared swimming pool,Community view,Near supermarket,Near public transportation,Near metro,Near restaurants,Basement parking,Study,Security,City view,Concierge Service,Spa,View of Landmark,Children\'s Play Area,Lobby in Building,Children\'s Pool\",\"size\":\"602\",\"size_measure\":\"Square Foot\",\"bedroom\":\"1\",\"bathroom\":\"1\",\"agent\":{\"id\":\"003Sq00000G5DyMIAV\",\"name\":\"Ruby Jane Dahang\",\"email\":\"ruby@morgansrealty.com\",\"phone\":\"971589096263\",\"photo\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/avatar\\/e8f9feeb14c91937feac04073294db03.