(282, 'EMAAR Beachfront', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Dubai Harbour, EMAAR Beachfront, Beachgate by Address', 'images/image_1733925474.png', '795', 1, 1, '0', 0.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgans International Realty is delighted to present this stunning 1-bedroom apartment at Beachgate by Address, Emaar. Nestled in a prime beachfront location, this residence offers sophisticated living with modern amenities and breathtaking views. \n\nCome home to Dubai’s most exclusive island, located within the new maritime centre of the UAE, Dubai Harbour. Emaar Beachfront is a meticulously master-planned waterfront haven – a unique blend of cosmopolitan living, prime location and a luxury seaside lifestyle. \n\nProperty Features: \n\n- 795.35 Sq ft \n- 1 Bedroom \n- 1 Bathroom\n- Mid-floor \n- Unfurnished \n- Handover 2026 \n- Unobstructed palm view\n\nAmenities : \n\n- Swimming pool \n- Kids pool \n- BBQ areas \n- Family gathering area \n- Community views \n- Fully Equipped gym\n- Sport court \n- Yoga area \n- Sport facilities \n- Childrens play \n- Multifunction room \n- Retail outlets at ground level \n\nNearby Landmarks : \n\n- 5 mins to Dubai Marina \n- 10 mins to Skydive Dubai \n- 15 mins to the pointe\n- 20 mins to Dubai Hills golf club \n- 15 mins to Safa park, Sheik zayed rd \n- 15 mins to Mall of Emirates \n- 15 mins to Dubai Miracle garden\n\nAt Morgans International Realty each of our team members aim to leave clients with a pleasant memory of their past, standing by and guiding them in their present and planning for their future.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:57:53', '2024-12-11 20:57:56', 'emaar-beachfront', 27, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '24,25,4,13,26,48,45,11,27,34,28,59,5,29,2,7,42,30,33', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1 BR | Handover 2026 | Palm View | Mid-floor', 'mir-AP7917', '55.1407235,25.0993211', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 09:10:33\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-AP7917\",\"offering_type\":\"Purchase\",\"property_type\":\"Apartment\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":\"3650000\",\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"service_charge\":\"0\",\"cheques\":\"0\",\"title_en\":\"1 BR | Handover 2026 | Palm View | Mid-floor\",\"description_en\":\"Morgans International Realty is delighted to present this stunning 1-bedroom apartment at Beachgate by Address, Emaar. Nestled in a prime beachfront location, this residence offers sophisticated living with modern amenities and breathtaking views. \\n\\nCome home to Dubai\\u2019s most exclusive island, located within the new maritime centre of the UAE, Dubai Harbour. Emaar Beachfront is a meticulously master-planned waterfront haven \\u2013 a unique blend of cosmopolitan living, prime location and a luxury seaside lifestyle. \\n\\nProperty Features: \\n\\n- 795.35 Sq ft \\n- 1 Bedroom \\n- 1 Bathroom\\n- Mid-floor \\n- Unfurnished \\n- Handover 2026 \\n- Unobstructed palm view\\n\\nAmenities : \\n\\n- Swimming pool \\n- Kids pool \\n- BBQ areas \\n- Family gathering area \\n- Community views \\n- Fully Equipped gym\\n- Sport court \\n- Yoga area \\n- Sport facilities \\n- Childrens play \\n- Multifunction room \\n- Retail outlets at ground level \\n\\nNearby Landmarks : \\n\\n- 5 mins to Dubai Marina \\n- 10 mins to Skydive Dubai \\n- 15 mins to the pointe\\n- 20 mins to Dubai Hills golf club \\n- 15 mins to Safa park, Sheik zayed rd \\n- 15 mins to Mall of Emirates \\n- 15 mins to Dubai Miracle garden\\n\\nAt Morgans International Realty each of our team members aim to leave clients with a pleasant memory of their past, standing by and guiding them in their present and planning for their future.\",\"private_amenities\":\"Balcony,Built in wardrobes,Central air conditioning,Covered parking,Shared swimming pool,Community view,Near mall,Near metro,Shared Gym,BBQ area,Kitchen Appliances,On mid floor,Security,Concierge Service,Spa,Maintenance,Walk-in Closet,Children\'s Play Area,Children\'s Pool\",\"size\":\"795\",\"size_measure\"