(283, 'The Terraces', 'UAE, Dubai', 'UAE, Dubai, Mohammed Bin Rashid City, The Terraces, ', 'images/image_1733925476.png', '699', 2, 1, '0', 0.00, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 'Morgans International Realty is pleased to offer you this amazing 1BR apartment on a high floor in the Terraces, Mohammed Bin Rashid City (MBR City). This stunning residence boasts modern interiors and offers a comfortable and luxurious living experience.\n\nProperty Details:\n\n* Spacious 1-bedroom apartment\n* Size: 699 Sqft\n* Modern interior design\n\nAmenities:\n\n* State-of-the-art Swimming Pool\n* Fully Equipped Fitness Center\n* 24/7 Security and CCTV Surveillance\n* Dedicated Parking Space\n* Close Proximity to Shopping and Dining Options\n\n\nThe Terraces in MBR City is a prestigious residential development known for its contemporary architecture and world-class amenities.\n\nMorgan’s International Realty is a luxury real estate brokerage and property investment consultancy firm. Established in Dubai at a tipping point of the industry, to create an impact in a market which was just evolving empowered by a joint effort of the public and private sectors, \n\nWe chose to participate in setting a benchmark of higher levels of transparency, professionalism and investor protection.', 'residential', NULL, 'active', '2024-12-11 20:57:56', '2024-12-11 20:57:59', 'the-terraces', 21, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '25,4,13,26,27,28,5,31,32,16', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'High Floor | Modern Interiors | Unit is Vacant', 'mir-MK5789', '55.2766574,25.1663758', '{\"@attributes\":{\"last_update\":\"2024-11-13 09:10:40\"},\"reference_number\":\"mir-MK5789\",\"offering_type\":\"Purchase\",\"property_type\":\"Apartment\",\"price_on_application\":\"No\",\"price\":\"1300000\",\"currency_code\":\"AED\",\"service_charge\":\"1\",\"cheques\":\"0\",\"title_en\":\"High Floor | Modern Interiors | Unit is Vacant\",\"description_en\":\"Morgans International Realty is pleased to offer you this amazing 1BR apartment on a high floor in the Terraces, Mohammed Bin Rashid City (MBR City). This stunning residence boasts modern interiors and offers a comfortable and luxurious living experience.\\n\\nProperty Details:\\n\\n* Spacious 1-bedroom apartment\\n* Size: 699 Sqft\\n* Modern interior design\\n\\nAmenities:\\n\\n* State-of-the-art Swimming Pool\\n* Fully Equipped Fitness Center\\n* 24\\/7 Security and CCTV Surveillance\\n* Dedicated Parking Space\\n* Close Proximity to Shopping and Dining Options\\n\\n\\nThe Terraces in MBR City is a prestigious residential development known for its contemporary architecture and world-class amenities.\\n\\nMorgan\\u2019s International Realty is a luxury real estate brokerage and property investment consultancy firm. Established in Dubai at a tipping point of the industry, to create an impact in a market which was just evolving empowered by a joint effort of the public and private sectors, \\n\\nWe chose to participate in setting a benchmark of higher levels of transparency, professionalism and investor protection.\",\"private_amenities\":\"Built in wardrobes,Central air conditioning,Covered parking,Shared swimming pool,Shared Gym,Kitchen Appliances,Security,Pets allowed,Maid Service,Lobby in Building\",\"size\":\"699\",\"size_measure\":\"Square Foot\",\"bedroom\":\"1\",\"bathroom\":\"2\",\"agent\":{\"id\":\"003J7000001TpfFIAS\",\"name\":\"Mountaser Kabbani\",\"email\":\"kabbani@morgansrealty.com\",\"phone\":\"971523679150\",\"photo\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/avatar\\/740e996ad3de3328685da0151e9bf439.jpg\\/public\"},\"title\":\"Agent\"},\"listing_status\":\"Active\",\"parking\":\"1\",\"furnished\":\"Unfurnished\",\"photo\":{\"url\":[\"https:\\/\\/img.propertyraptor.com\\/cdn-cgi\\/imagedelivery\\/KD5bF_AFL0JDTbKLWF7z9g\\/eu20\\/eu20_001\\/hornet\\/prp\\/img\\/476f7d7b9b6c6b66d2b4a3f419a55c7f-wtm.png\\/public\",\"https:\\/\\